  ('A-jupiter_B-mars_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"mars","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-mars_trine', 'synastry-jupiter-trine-mars', 'relationship-jupiter-trine-mars']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-mars_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-mars_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Trine Mars', null, 'This person makes you believe you can do it. Their confidence feeds your drive. Your drive gives their optimism somewhere to go. Together, you tend to move toward things instead of talking yourselves out of them. What feels intimidating alone can feel possible together.

You bring out each other''s courage. You back each other''s goals, encourage each other''s risks, and make it easier to trust your own abilities. There is a natural sense of momentum here. Less second-guessing. More doing.

The challenge is that things come so easily between you that you may not push yourselves to use the gift. It feels good to believe in what is possible. It is another thing to actually commit to it.

This connection offers confidence. The invitation is to do something with it. Potential is not the same as movement. Let the encouragement land. Take the step. Trust yourself enough to begin.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person makes you believe you can do it. Their confidence feeds your drive. Your drive gives their optimism somewhere to go. Together, you tend to move toward things instead of talking yourselves out of them. What feels intimidating alone can feel possible together.\n\nYou bring out each other''s courage. You back each other''s goals, encourage each other''s risks, and make it easier to trust your own abilities. There is a natural sense of momentum here. Less second-guessing. More doing.\n\nThe challenge is that things come so easily between you that you may not push yourselves to use the gift. It feels good to believe in what is possible. It is another thing to actually commit to it.\n\nThis connection offers confidence. The invitation is to do something with it. Potential is not the same as movement. Let the encouragement land. Take the step. Trust yourself enough to begin."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is that things come so easily between you that you may not push yourselves to use the gift. It feels good to believe in what is possible. It is another thing to actually commit to it."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"This connection offers confidence. The invitation is to do something with it. Potential is not the same as movement. Let the encouragement land. Take the step. Trust yourself enough to begin."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-mars_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s drive. The trine lets them flow together easily.","summaryDeep":"This person makes you believe you can do it. Their confidence feeds your drive. Your drive gives their optimism somewhere to go. Together, you tend to move toward things instead of talking yourselves out of them. What feels intimidating alone can feel possible together.\n\nYou bring out each other''s courage. You back each other''s goals, encourage each other''s risks, and make it easier to trust your own abilities. There is a natural sense of momentum here. Less second-guessing. More doing.\n\nThe challenge is that things come so easily between you that you may not push yourselves to use the gift. It feels good to believe in what is possible. It is another thing to actually commit to it.\n\nThis connection offers confidence. The invitation is to do something with it. Potential is not the same as movement. Let the encouragement land. Take the step. Trust yourself enough to begin.","tension":"The challenge is that things come so easily between you that you may not push yourselves to use the gift. It feels good to believe in what is possible. It is another thing to actually commit to it.","advice":"This connection offers confidence. The invitation is to do something with it. Potential is not the same as movement. Let the encouragement land. Take the step. Trust yourself enough to begin.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-mercury_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"mercury","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-mercury_conjunction', 'synastry-jupiter-conjunction-mercury', 'relationship-jupiter-conjunction-mercury']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-mercury_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-mercury_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Conjunction Mercury', null, 'This is the person who reminds you not to think so small. You bring them an idea, a question, a possibility, and somehow it comes back larger. They see opportunities where you see loose ends. They spot potential before there is proof. Their perspective can help you zoom out from the immediate problem and reconnect with the bigger vision of what you are trying to create.

They have a way of helping you see beyond the limits you place on yourself. Through conversation, they broaden your perspective, encourage you to think bigger, and remind you of possibilities you may have overlooked. Around them, your ideas often feel more viable, and your confidence in pursuing them tends to grow.

There is something deeply affirming about being seen this way. Their faith in your potential can help you access more of it. They remind you that your ideas deserve room to develop, that curiosity is worth following, and that ambition is not something you need to apologize for.

The challenge is that inspiration can start to masquerade as progress. A conversation can feel so productive, so exciting, so full of possibility that neither of you notices nothing has actually moved forward yet. The vision expands, but the next step remains undefined.

Take the encouragement. Take the perspective. Then bring it down to earth.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This is the person who reminds you not to think so small. You bring them an idea, a question, a possibility, and somehow it comes back larger. They see opportunities where you see loose ends. They spot potential before there is proof. Their perspective can help you zoom out from the immediate problem and reconnect with the bigger vision of what you are trying to create.\n\nThey have a way of helping you see beyond the limits you place on yourself. Through conversation, they broaden your perspective, encourage you to think bigger, and remind you of possibilities you may have overlooked. Around them, your ideas often feel more viable, and your confidence in pursuing them tends to grow.\n\nThere is something deeply affirming about being seen this way. Their faith in your potential can help you access more of it. They remind you that your ideas deserve room to develop, that curiosity is worth following, and that ambition is not something you need to apologize for.\n\nThe challenge is that inspiration can start to masquerade as progress. A conversation can feel so productive, so exciting, so full of possibility that neither of you notices nothing has actually moved forward yet. The vision expands, but the next step remains undefined.\n\nTake the encouragement. Take the perspective. Then bring it down to earth."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is that inspiration can start to masquerade as progress. A conversation can feel so productive, so exciting, so full of possibility that neither of you notices nothing has actually moved forward yet. The vision expands, but the next step remains undefined."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Take the encouragement. Take the perspective. Then bring it down to earth."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-mercury_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s mind. The conjunction fuses them - intense and inseparable.","summaryDeep":"This is the person who reminds you not to think so small. You bring them an idea, a question, a possibility, and somehow it comes back larger. They see opportunities where you see loose ends. They spot potential before there is proof. Their perspective can help you zoom out from the immediate problem and reconnect with the bigger vision of what you are trying to create.\n\nThey have a way of helping you see beyond the limits you place on yourself. Through conversation, they broaden your perspective, encourage you to think bigger, and remind you of possibilities you may have overlooked. Around them, your ideas often feel more viable, and your confidence in pursuing them tends to grow.\n\nThere is something deeply affirming about being seen this way. Their faith in your potential can help you access more of it. They remind you that your ideas deserve room to develop, that curiosity is worth following, and that ambition is not something you need to apologize for.\n\nThe challenge is that inspiration can start to masquerade as progress. A conversation can feel so productive, so exciting, so full of possibility that neither of you notices nothing has actually moved forward yet. The vision expands, but the next step remains undefined.\n\nTake the encouragement. Take the perspective. Then bring it down to earth.","tension":"The challenge is that inspiration can start to masquerade as progress. A conversation can feel so productive, so exciting, so full of possibility that neither of you notices nothing has actually moved forward yet. The vision expands, but the next step remains undefined.","advice":"Take the encouragement. Take the perspective. Then bring it down to earth.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","a