  ('A-jupiter_B-uranus_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"uranus","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-uranus_trine', 'synastry-jupiter-trine-uranus', 'relationship-jupiter-trine-uranus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-uranus_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-uranus_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Trine Uranus', null, 'A''s growth meets B''s need for freedom. The trine lets them flow together easily.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Translation","body":"A''s growth meets B''s need for freedom. The trine lets them flow together easily."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-uranus_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s need for freedom. The trine lets them flow together easily.","summaryDeep":null,"tension":null,"advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":null,"weight":null}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-venus_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"venus","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-venus_conjunction', 'synastry-jupiter-conjunction-venus', 'relationship-jupiter-conjunction-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-venus_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-venus_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Conjunction Venus', null, 'This person expands your capacity for joy. Being with them can remind you that relationships are not only about solving problems or building security. They are also about feeling appreciated, welcomed, and genuinely enjoyed. Their presence may make it easier for you to relax, open up, and trust that there is enough affection, attention, and goodwill to go around.

When this works, you bring out each other''s confidence in life. You celebrate wins together. You encourage each other''s growth. You create an atmosphere where generosity feels natural and where both people feel seen for what is good and valuable in them. There is a sense of possibility here, as though the relationship helps both of you believe in more.

One of the gifts of this connection is that it can shift your mindset from scarcity to abundance. Instead of focusing on what is missing, you notice what is working. Instead of withholding appreciation, you offer it freely. The relationship can become a source of encouragement, optimism, and emotional nourishment.

The challenge is remembering that growth requires honesty as well as positivity. It is easy to focus on the good and overlook what needs attention. You may avoid difficult conversations, assume things will work themselves out, or mistake comfort for progress.

Enjoy what is good, but do not ignore what needs attention. This connection works best when appreciation and responsibility are both present.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person expands your capacity for joy. Being with them can remind you that relationships are not only about solving problems or building security. They are also about feeling appreciated, welcomed, and genuinely enjoyed. Their presence may make it easier for you to relax, open up, and trust that there is enough affection, attention, and goodwill to go around.\n\nWhen this works, you bring out each other''s confidence in life. You celebrate wins together. You encourage each other''s growth. You create an atmosphere where generosity feels natural and where both people feel seen for what is good and valuable in them. There is a sense of possibility here, as though the relationship helps both of you believe in more.\n\nOne of the gifts of this connection is that it can shift your mindset from scarcity to abundance. Instead of focusing on what is missing, you notice what is working. Instead of withholding appreciation, you offer it freely. The relationship can become a source of encouragement, optimism, and emotional nourishment.\n\nThe challenge is remembering that growth requires honesty as well as positivity. It is easy to focus on the good and overlook what needs attention. You may avoid difficult conversations, assume things will work themselves out, or mistake comfort for progress.\n\nEnjoy what is good, but do not ignore what needs attention. This connection works best when appreciation and responsibility are both present."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is remembering that growth requires honesty as well as positivity. It is easy to focus on the good and overlook what needs attention. You may avoid difficult conversations, assume things will work themselves out, or mistake comfort for progress."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Enjoy what is good, but do not ignore what needs attention. This connection works best when appreciation and responsibility are both present."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-venus_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s love and values. The conjunction fuses them - intense and inseparable.","summaryDeep":"This person expands your capacity for joy. Being with them can remind you that relationships are not only about solving problems or building security. They are also about feeling appreciated, welcomed, and genuinely enjoyed. Their presence may make it easier for you to relax, open up, and trust that there is enough affection, attention, and goodwill to go around.\n\nWhen this works, you bring out each other''s confidence in life. You celebrate wins together. You encourage each other''s growth. You create an atmosphere where generosity feels natural and where both people feel seen for what is good and valuable in them. There is a sense of possibility here, as though the relationship helps both of you believe in more.\n\nOne of the gifts of this connection is that it can shift your mindset from scarcity to abundance. Instead of focusing on what is missing, you notice what is working. Instead of withholding appreciation, you offer it freely. The relationship can become a source of encouragement, optimism, and emotional nourishment.\n\nThe challenge is remembering that growth requires honesty as well as positivity. It is easy to focus on the good and overlook what needs attention. You may avoid difficult conversations, assume things will work themselves out, or mistake comfort for progress.\n\nEnjoy what is good, but do not ignore what needs attention. This connection works best when appreciation and responsibility are both present.","tension":"The challenge is remembering that growth requires honesty as well as positivity. It is easy to focus on the good and overlook what needs attention. You may avoid difficult conversations, assume things will work themselves out, or mistake comfort for progress.","advice":"Enjoy what is good, but do not ignore what needs attention. This connection works best when appreciation and responsibility are both present.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-venus_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"venus","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-venus_opposition', 'synastry-jupiter-opposition-venus', 'relationship-jupiter-opposition-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-venus_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-venus_opposition","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Opposition Venus', null, 'This person may bring more. More generosity. More enthusiasm. More willingness to say yes to what feels good. Part of you may find that deeply refreshing. Another part may wonder where the limit is. They can encourage you to open up to life''s pleasures while also challenging your sense of balance, moderation, and what feels sustainable.

This connection asks both of you to examine your relationship with receiving. They may encourage you to loosen your grip, trust life a little more, and stop acting as though joy always has to be justified. You may help them recognize when enough is enough and make better choices about where their time, energy, and generosity go.

The tension appears when your differences start to feel like judgments. A difference in perspective can slowly harden into a question of whose truth gets to lead. They may experience your caution as a limit on what is possible, while you may experience their faith in expansion as a refusal to acknowledge reality. Over time, what began as a difference in style can become a story about who has the better way of moving through life.

This connection is not about proving whose approach is right. It is about recognizing that both of your instincts can become excessive in different ways, and finding a balance that serves the relationship better than either extreme. Neither person needs to become the other. The goal is to find a balance where generosity has room to breathe and good judgment still has a voice.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person may bring more. More generosity. More enthusiasm. More willingness to say yes to what feels good. Part of you may find that deeply refreshing. Another part may wonder where the limit is. They can encourage you to open up to life''s pleasures while also challenging your sense of balance, moderation, and what feels sustainable.\n\nThis connection asks both of you to examine your relationship with receiving. They may encourage you to loosen your grip, trust life a little more, and stop acting as though joy always has to be justified. You may help them recognize when enough is enough and make better choices about where their time, energy, and generosity go.\n\nThe tension appears when your differences start to feel like judgments. A difference in perspective can slowly harden into a question of whose truth gets to lead. They may experience your caution as a limit on what is possible, while you may experience their faith in expansion as a refusal to acknowledge reality. Over time, what began as a difference in style can become a story about who has the better way of moving through life.\n\nThis connection is not about proving whose approach is right. It is about recognizing that both of your instincts can become excessive in different ways, and finding a balance that serves the relationship better than either extreme. Neither person needs to become the other. The goal is to find a balance where generosity has room to breathe and good judgment still has a voice."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The tension appears when your differences start to feel like judgments. A difference in perspective can slowly harden into a question of whose truth gets to lead. They may experience your caution as a limit on what is possible, while you may experience their faith in expansion as a refusal to acknowledge reality. Over time, what began as a difference in style can become a story about who has the better way of moving through life."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"This connection is not about proving whose approach is right. It is about recognizing that both of your instincts can become excessive in different ways, and finding a balance that serves the relationship better than either extreme. Neither person needs to become the other. The goal is to find a balance where generosity has room to breathe and good judgment still has a voice."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-venus_opposition","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s love and values. The opposition pulls them into push-and-pull.","summaryDeep":"This person may bring more. More generosity. More enthusiasm. More willingness to say yes to what feels good. Part of you may find that deeply refreshing. Another part may wonder where the limit is. They can encourage you to open up to life''s pleasures while also challenging your sense of balance, moderation, and what feels sustainable.\n\nThis connection asks both of you to examine your relationship with receiving. They may encourage you to loosen your grip, trust life a little more, and stop acting as though joy always has to be justified. You may help them recognize when enough is enough and make better choices about where their time, energy, and generosity go.\n\nThe tension appears when your differences start to feel like judgments. A difference in perspective can slowly harden into a question of whose truth gets to lead. They may experience your caution as a limit on what is possible, while you may experience their faith in expansion as a refusal to acknowledge reality. Over time, what began as a difference in style can become a story about who has the better way of moving through life.\n\nThis connection is not about proving whose approach is right. It is about recognizing that both of your instincts can become excessive in different ways, and finding a balance that serves the relationship better than either extreme. Neither person needs to become the other. The goal is to find a balance where generosity has room to breathe and good judgment still has a voice.","tension":"The tension appears when your differences start to feel like judgments. A difference in perspective can slowly harden into a question of whose truth gets to lead. They may experience your caution as a limit on what is possible, while you may experience their faith in expansion as a refusal to acknowledge reality. Over time, what began as a difference in style can become a story about who has the better way of moving through life.","advice":"This connection is not about proving whose approach is right. It is about recognizing that both of your instincts can become excessive in different ways, and finding a balance that serves the relationship better than either extreme. Neither person needs to become the other. The goal is to find a balance where generosity has room to breathe and good judgment still has a voice.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-venus_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"venus","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-venus_sextile', 'synastry-jupiter-sextile-venus', 'relationship-jupiter-sextile-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-venus_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-venus_sextile","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Sextile Venus', null, 'This person likes you. Roots for you, sees the best in you, makes you feel good without you having to earn it. Right away it''s obvious this could be one of the easy, happy ones, a connection that adds to your life instead of draining it.

The good feeling won''t do the work for you. A little effort goes a long way here, the text that says you were thinking of them, the plan you actually make, saying the nice thing out loud instead of figuring they know. Small stuff, and it adds up fast.

That''s the catch with this one. The warmth opens the door and then just stands there. Coast on it, assume it runs itself, and you end up with a great connection you never actually used.

So treat it like anything good. Show up for it. The more you put in, the more this person becomes someone you can count on, instead of a nice thing you let slip.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person likes you. Roots for you, sees the best in you, makes you feel good without you having to earn it. Right away it''s obvious this could be one of the easy, happy ones, a connection that adds to your life instead of draining it.\n\nThe good feeling won''t do the work for you. A little effort goes a long way here, the text that says you were thinking of them, the plan you actually make, saying the nice thing out loud instead of figuring they know. Small stuff, and it adds up fast.\n\nThat''s the catch with this one. The warmth opens the door and then just stands there. Coast on it, assume it runs itself, and you end up with a great connection you never actually used.\n\nSo treat it like anything good. Show up for it. The more you put in, the more this person becomes someone you can count on, instead of a nice thing you let slip."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"That''s the catch with this one. The warmth opens the door and then just stands there. Coast on it, assume it runs itself, and you end up with a great connection you never actually used."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"So treat it like anything good. Show up for it. The more you put in, the more this person becomes someone you can count on, instead of a nice thing you let slip."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-venus_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s love and values. The sextile supports them, if you act on it.","summaryDeep":"This person likes you. Roots for you, sees the best in you, makes you feel good without you having to earn it. Right away it''s obvious this could be one of the easy, happy ones, a connection that adds to your life instead of draining it.\n\nThe good feeling won''t do the work for you. A little effort goes a long way here, the text that says you were thinking of them, the plan you actually make, saying the nice thing out loud instead of figuring they know. Small stuff, and it adds up fast.\n\nThat''s the catch with this one. The warmth opens the door and then just stands there. Coast on it, assume it runs itself, and you end up with a great connection you never actually used.\n\nSo treat it like anything good. Show up for it. The more you put in, the more this person becomes someone you can count on, instead of a nice thing you let slip.","tension":"That''s the catch with this one. The warmth opens the door and then just stands there. Coast on it, assume it runs itself, and you end up with a great connection you never actually used.","advice":"So treat it like anything good. Show up for it. The more you put in, the more this person becomes someone you can count on, instead of a nice thing you let slip.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-venus_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"venus","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-venus_square', 'synastry-jupiter-square-venus', 'relationship-jupiter-square-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-venus_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-venus_square","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Square Venus', null, 'This person may awaken in you a larger appetite for life. In their presence, pleasure expands. You may feel drawn to celebrate more, give more, forgive more, and say yes to experiences you would normally hold at a distance. There is a temptation to get carried away by what feels good in the moment. This can be a blessing, because it encourages openness, generosity, and joy. But it can also become a kind of unconsciousness when enjoyment begins to run ahead of awareness.

When this works, they help you soften. They may remind you that joy matters, that generosity matters, that life does not have to be all restraint and responsibility. Their presence can pull you out of scarcity and into a more open relationship with pleasure.

The challenge is excess. Too much spending. Too much saying yes because the moment feels good. Too much relying on good feelings to carry the relationship instead of addressing what needs attention. This is where the connection needs honesty. Pleasure is not the problem. Avoidance is. Generosity is not the problem. Lack of limits is.

Let this person broaden your perspective without losing sight of your priorities. This connection works best when both people appreciate the opportunities in front of them while staying realistic.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person may awaken in you a larger appetite for life. In their presence, pleasure expands. You may feel drawn to celebrate more, give more, forgive more, and say yes to experiences you would normally hold at a distance. There is a temptation to get carried away by what feels good in the moment. This can be a blessing, because it encourages openness, generosity, and joy. But it can also become a kind of unconsciousness when enjoyment begins to run ahead of awareness.\n\nWhen this works, they help you soften. They may remind you that joy matters, that generosity matters, that life does not have to be all restraint and responsibility. Their presence can pull you out of scarcity and into a more open relationship with pleasure.\n\nThe challenge is excess. Too much spending. Too much saying yes because the moment feels good. Too much relying on good feelings to carry the relationship instead of addressing what needs attention. This is where the connection needs honesty. Pleasure is not the problem. Avoidance is. Generosity is not the problem. Lack of limits is.\n\nLet this person broaden your perspective without losing sight of your priorities. This connection works best when both people appreciate the opportunities in front of them while staying realistic."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is excess. Too much spending. Too much saying yes because the moment feels good. Too much relying on good feelings to carry the relationship instead of addressing what needs attention. This is where the connection needs honesty. Pleasure is not the problem. Avoidance is. Generosity is not the problem. Lack of limits is."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Let this person broaden your perspective without losing sight of your priorities. This connection works best when both people appreciate the opportunities in front of them while staying realistic."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-venus_square","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s love and values. The square puts them in friction.","summaryDeep":"This person may awaken in you a larger appetite for life. In their presence, pleasure expands. You may feel drawn to celebrate more, give more, forgive more, and say yes to experiences you would normally hold at a distance. There is a temptation to get carried away by what feels good in the moment. This can be a blessing, because it encourages openness, generosity, and joy. But it can also become a kind of unconsciousness when enjoyment begins to run ahead of awareness.\n\nWhen this works, they help you soften. They may remind you that joy matters, that generosity matters, that life does not have to be all restraint and responsibility. Their presence can pull you out of scarcity and into a more open relationship with pleasure.\n\nThe challenge is excess. Too much spending. Too much saying yes because the moment feels good. Too much relying on good feelings to carry the relationship instead of addressing what needs attention. This is where the connection needs honesty. Pleasure is not the problem. Avoidance is. Generosity is not the problem. Lack of limits is.\n\nLet this person broaden your perspective without losing sight of your priorities. This connection works best when both people appreciate the opportunities in front of them while staying realistic.","tension":"The challenge is excess. Too much spending. Too much saying yes because the moment feels good. Too much relying on good feelings to carry the relationship instead of addressing what needs attention. This is where the connection needs honesty. Pleasure is not the problem. Avoidance is. Generosity is not the problem. Lack of limits is.","advice":"Let this person broaden your perspective without losing sight of your priorities. This connection works best when both people appreciate the opportunities in front of them while staying realistic.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-jupiter_B-venus_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"jupiter","planetB":"venus","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-jupiter_B-venus_trine', 'synastry-jupiter-trine-venus', 'relationship-jupiter-trine-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-jupiter_B-venus_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-jupiter_B-venus_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Jupiter Trine Venus', null, 'This relationship has a way of bringing out the best in both of you. You tend to give each other the benefit of the doubt, let small mistakes go, and pay more attention to what is working than what is not. Being together usually feels good. You enjoy each other, and life can seem a little easier in each other''s company.

When this works, the relationship creates a sense of momentum. You encourage each other to take up space, pursue what matters, and enjoy the good things life has to offer. Time together can leave both of you feeling more optimistic than before, as though the relationship reminds you of your strengths rather than your limitations. There is a natural generosity in the way you relate, making it easier to feel supported, appreciated, and genuinely happy for each other''s growth.

One of the best things about this connection is that it helps you appreciate what is working. It encourages both of you to enjoy the relationship instead of focusing only on responsibilities or problems. Time together can feel genuinely enjoyable, creating moments of happiness and connection that bring you closer.

A relationship can feel good and still need attention, effort, and honest conversation to keep moving forward.

Enjoy the vibe and everything that flows easily between you, but don''t just coast on it. Keep showing up, keep putting something into it. The connections that last are the ones people choose again and again, not just the ones that start out easy.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This relationship has a way of bringing out the best in both of you. You tend to give each other the benefit of the doubt, let small mistakes go, and pay more attention to what is working than what is not. Being together usually feels good. You enjoy each other, and life can seem a little easier in each other''s company.\n\nWhen this works, the relationship creates a sense of momentum. You encourage each other to take up space, pursue what matters, and enjoy the good things life has to offer. Time together can leave both of you feeling more optimistic than before, as though the relationship reminds you of your strengths rather than your limitations. There is a natural generosity in the way you relate, making it easier to feel supported, appreciated, and genuinely happy for each other''s growth.\n\nOne of the best things about this connection is that it helps you appreciate what is working. It encourages both of you to enjoy the relationship instead of focusing only on responsibilities or problems. Time together can feel genuinely enjoyable, creating moments of happiness and connection that bring you closer.\n\nA relationship can feel good and still need attention, effort, and honest conversation to keep moving forward.\n\nEnjoy the vibe and everything that flows easily between you, but don''t just coast on it. Keep showing up, keep putting something into it. The connections that last are the ones people choose again and again, not just the ones that start out easy."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"A relationship can feel good and still need attention, effort, and honest conversation to keep moving forward."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Enjoy the vibe and everything that flows easily between you, but don''t just coast on it. Keep showing up, keep putting something into it. The connections that last are the ones people choose again and again, not just the ones that start out easy."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-jupiter_B-venus_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s growth meets B''s love and values. The trine lets them flow together easily.","summaryDeep":"This relationship has a way of bringing out the best in both of you. You tend to give each other the benefit of the doubt, let small mistakes go, and pay more attention to what is working than what is not. Being together usually feels good. You enjoy each other, and life can seem a little easier in each other''s company.\n\nWhen this works, the relationship creates a sense of momentum. You encourage each other to take up space, pursue what matters, and enjoy the good things life has to offer. Time together can leave both of you feeling more optimistic than before, as though the relationship reminds you of your strengths rather than your limitations. There is a natural generosity in the way you relate, making it easier to feel supported, appreciated, and genuinely happy for each other''s growth.\n\nOne of the best things about this connection is that it helps you appreciate what is working. It encourages both of you to enjoy the relationship instead of focusing only on responsibilities or problems. Time together can feel genuinely enjoyable, creating moments of happiness and connection that bring you closer.\n\nA relationship can feel good and still need attention, effort, and honest conversation to keep moving forward.\n\nEnjoy the vibe and everything that flows easily between you, but don''t just coast on it. Keep showing up, keep putting something into it. The connections that last are the ones people choose again and again, not just the ones that start out easy.","tension":"A relationship can feel good and still need attention, effort, and honest conversation to keep moving forward.","advice":"Enjoy the vibe and everything that flows easily between you, but don''t just coast on it. Keep showing up, keep putting something into it. The connections that last are the ones people choose again and again, not just the ones that start out easy.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-mars_B-jupiter_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mars","planetB":"jupiter","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mars_B-jupiter_conjunction', 'synastry-mars-conjunction-jupiter', 'relationship-mars-conjunction-jupiter']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mars_B-jupiter_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mars_B-jupiter_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mars Conjunction Jupiter', null, 'This person makes you go for it.

Around them, you are likely to feel more confident, more energized, and more willing to take a chance. They make big moves seem doable. What you would normally overthink, you may just do.

When this works, you build momentum fast. They believe in the possibility. You supply the action. Together, you can get a lot done because neither of you spends much time sitting on the sidelines.

The upside is obvious: you push each other forward. This is the person who talks you into applying, launching, asking, starting, or taking the leap.

The downside is just as obvious: you can talk each other into things that are not actually good ideas. Confidence is not a plan. Enthusiasm is not preparation. You may assume everything will work out because it feels exciting to believe it will.

This connection is strongest when you pair courage with common sense. Go for it. Just know what you are getting into first.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person makes you go for it.\n\nAround them, you are likely to feel more confident, more energized, and more willing to take a chance. They make big moves seem doable. What you would normally overthink, you may just do.\n\nWhen this works, you build momentum fast. They believe in the possibility. You supply the action. Together, you can get a lot done because neither of you spends much time sitting on the sidelines.\n\nThe upside is obvious: you push each other forward. This is the person who talks you into applying, launching, asking, starting, or taking the leap.\n\nThe downside is just as obvious: you can talk each other into things that are not actually good ideas. Confidence is not a plan. Enthusiasm is not preparation. You may assume everything will work out because it feels exciting to believe it will.\n\nThis connection is strongest when you pair courage with common sense. Go for it. Just know what you are getting into first."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The downside is just as obvious: you can talk each other into things that are not actually good ideas. Confidence is not a plan. Enthusiasm is not preparation. You may assume everything will work out because it feels exciting to believe it will."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"This connection is strongest when you pair courage with common sense. Go for it. Just know what you are getting into first."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-mars_B-jupiter_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s drive meets B''s growth. The conjunction fuses them - intense and inseparable.","summaryDeep":"This person makes you go for it.\n\nAround them, you are likely to feel more confident, more energized, and more willing to take a chance. They make big moves seem doable. What you would normally overthink, you may just do.\n\nWhen this works, you b