  ('A-mars_B-jupiter_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mars","planetB":"jupiter","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mars_B-jupiter_opposition', 'synastry-mars-opposition-jupiter', 'relationship-mars-opposition-jupiter']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mars_B-jupiter_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mars_B-jupiter_opposition","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mars Opposition Jupiter', null, 'This person may push you toward more than you feel ready for.

One of you may want to move quickly, take the risk, and trust the outcome. The other may need more time, more information, or a clearer plan. The difference can be frustrating, but it can also be useful.

Together, you can balance each other out. One person is ready to jump. The other sees what could go wrong. When you listen to both instincts, you take better risks and make fewer avoidable mistakes.

The challenge is that you can start fighting each other instead of solving the problem. They think you are dragging your feet. You think they are making bad decisions. They push. You resist. Before long, you are arguing about who is right instead of figuring out what actually makes sense.

This connection works best when both people respect what the other is protecting. One of you is trying to make sure the opportunity doesn''t pass. The other is trying to make sure you don''t create a bigger problem chasing it. Stop arguing about speed and get clear on the goal. Once you know what you''re actually trying to achieve, it becomes much easier to decide how fast to move.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person may push you toward more than you feel ready for.\n\nOne of you may want to move quickly, take the risk, and trust the outcome. The other may need more time, more information, or a clearer plan. The difference can be frustrating, but it can also be useful.\n\nTogether, you can balance each other out. One person is ready to jump. The other sees what could go wrong. When you listen to both instincts, you take better risks and make fewer avoidable mistakes.\n\nThe challenge is that you can start fighting each other instead of solving the problem. They think you are dragging your feet. You think they are making bad decisions. They push. You resist. Before long, you are arguing about who is right instead of figuring out what actually makes sense.\n\nThis connection works best when both people respect what the other is protecting. One of you is trying to make sure the opportunity doesn''t pass. The other is trying to make sure you don''t create a bigger problem chasing it. Stop arguing about speed and get clear on the goal. Once you know what you''re actually trying to achieve, it becomes much easier to decide how fast to move."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is that you can start fighting each other instead of solving the problem. They think you are dragging your feet. You think they are making bad decisions. They push. You resist. Before long, you are arguing about who is right instead of figuring out what actually makes sense."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"This connection works best when both people respect what the other is protecting. One of you is trying to make sure the opportunity doesn''t pass. The other is trying to make sure you don''t create a bigger problem chasing it. Stop arguing about speed and get clear on the goal. Once you know what you''re actually trying to achieve, it becomes much easier to decide how fast to move."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-mars_B-jupiter_opposition","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s drive meets B''s growth. The opposition pulls them into push-and-pull.","summaryDeep":"This person may push you toward more than you feel ready for.\n\nOne of you may want to move quickly, take the risk, and trust the outcome. The other may need more time, more information, or a clearer plan. The difference can be frustrating, but it can also be useful.\n\nTogether, you can balance each other out. One person is ready to jump. The other sees what could go wrong. When you listen to both instincts, you take better risks and make fewer avoidable mistakes.\n\nThe challenge is that you can start fighting each other instead of solving the problem. They think you are dragging your feet. You think they are making bad decisions. They push. You resist. Before long, you are arguing about who is right instead of figuring out what actually makes sense.\n\nThis connection works best when both people respect what the other is protecting. One of you is trying to make sure the opportunity doesn''t pass. The other is trying to make sure you don''t create a bigger problem chasing it. Stop arguing about speed and get clear on the goal. Once you know what you''re actually trying to achieve, it becomes much easier to decide how fast to move.","tension":"The challenge is that you can start fighting each other instead of solving the problem. They think you are dragging your feet. You think they are making bad decisions. They push. You resist. Before long, you are arguing about who is right instead of figuring out what actually makes sense.","advice":"This connection works best when both people respect what the other is protecting. One of you is trying to make sure the opportunity doesn''t pass. The other is trying to make sure you don''t create a bigger problem chasing it. Stop arguing about speed and get clear on the goal. Once you know what you''re actually trying to achieve, it becomes much easier to decide how fast to move.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-mars_B-jupiter_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mars","planetB":"jupiter","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mars_B-jupiter_sextile', 'synastry-mars-sextile-jupiter', 'relationship-mars-sextile-jupiter']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mars_B-jupiter_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mars_B-jupiter_sextile","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mars Sextile Jupiter', null, 'This connection gives you a push. This person can make you feel braver, more willing to take a chance, more ready to go after what you want. They believe in your potential. They encourage the risk. They remind you that waiting forever is not a strategy.

You help each other get moving in a way that builds on itself. When one person takes a step, the other tends to add confidence, encouragement, or momentum, making it easier to keep going. Ideas do not sit around for long. Together, you are more likely to act on a plan than just talk about it.

The challenge is laziness. You can both see what is possible and still do nothing about it. You can talk about the dream, believe in the dream, and never take the step that makes it real.

This connection becomes powerful when someone is willing to take the first step.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This connection gives you a push. This person can make you feel braver, more willing to take a chance, more ready to go after what you want. They believe in your potential. They encourage the risk. They remind you that waiting forever is not a strategy.\n\nYou help each other get moving in a way that builds on itself. When one person takes a step, the other tends to add confidence, encouragement, or momentum, making it easier to keep going. Ideas do not sit around for long. Together, you are more likely to act on a plan than just talk about it.\n\nThe challenge is laziness. You can both see what is possible and still do nothing about it. You can talk about the dream, believe in the dream, and never take the step that makes it real.\n\nThis connection becomes powerful when someone is willing to take the first step."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is laziness. You can both see what is possible and still do nothing about it. You can talk about the dream, believe in the dream, and never take the step that makes it real."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"This connection becomes powerful when someone is willing to take the first step."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-mars_B-jupiter_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s drive meets B''s growth. The sextile supports them, if you act on it.","summaryDeep":"This connection gives you a push. This person can make you feel braver, more willing to take a chance, more ready to go after what you want. They believe in your potential. They encourage the risk. They remind you that waiting forever is not a strategy.\n\nYou help each other get moving in a way that builds on itself. When one person takes a step, the other tends to add confidence, encouragement, or momentum, making it easier to keep going. Ideas do not sit around for long. Together, you are more likely to act on a plan than just talk about it.\n\nThe challenge is laziness. You can both see what is possible and still do nothing about it. You can talk about the dream, believe in the dream, and never take the step that makes it real.\n\nThis connection becomes powerful when someone is willing to take the first step.","tension":"The challenge is laziness. You can both see what is possible and still do nothing about it. You can talk about the dream, believe in the dream, and never take the step that makes it real.","advice":"This connection becomes powerful when someone is willing to take the first step.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-mars_B-jupiter_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mars","planetB":"jupiter","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mars_B-jupiter_square', 'synastry-mars-square-jupiter', 'relationship-mars-square-jupiter']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mars_B-jupiter_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mars_B-jupiter_square","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mars Square Jupiter', null, 'This person can push you further than you should go. The chemistry here is energizing, but it can also make bad ideas sound brilliant. They may encourage you to take bigger risks, move faster, or commit before you have thought things through. Around them, caution can start to feel boring, and that is exactly where the trouble starts.

They help you stop playing small. They challenge excuses, call out fear, and push you to take chances you might otherwise avoid. Sometimes that is exactly what you need.

The problem is that neither of you may know when to slow down. Confidence can become overconfidence. Encouragement can start to feel like pressure. You can get so caught up in the momentum that neither of you stops to check whether the risk is worth it. The excitement is real. So are the consequences.

This connection can help you step outside your comfort zone and trust yourself more. It encourages growth through action, reminding you that confidence is built by taking meaningful steps forward. Be willing to take the chance when it aligns with your goals and values. Just remember that enthusiasm is most powerful when it is paired with preparation and intention.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person can push you further than you should go. The chemistry here is energizing, but it can also make bad ideas sound brilliant. They may encourage you to take bigger risks, move faster, or commit before you have thought things through. Around them, caution can start to feel boring, and that is exactly where the trouble starts.\n\nThey help you stop playing small. They challenge excuses, call out fear, and push you to take chances you might otherwise avoid. Sometimes that is exactly what you need.\n\nThe problem is that neither of you may know when to slow down. Confidence can become overconfidence. Encouragement can start to feel like pressure. You can get so caught up in the momentum that neither of you stops to check whether the risk is worth it. The excitement is real. So are the consequences.\n\nThis connection can help you step outside your comfort zone and trust yourself more. It encourages growth through action, reminding you that confidence is built by taking meaningful steps forward. Be willing to take the chance when it aligns with your goals and values. Just remember that enthusiasm is most powerful when it is paired with preparation and intention."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The problem is that neither of you may know when to slow down. Confidence can become overconfidence. Encouragement can start to feel like pressure. You can get so caught up in the momentum that neither of you stops to check whether the risk is worth it. The excitement is real. So are the consequences."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"This connection can help you step 