  ('A-mars_B-sun_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mars","planetB":"sun","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mars_B-sun_opposition', 'synastry-mars-opposition-sun', 'relationship-mars-opposition-sun']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mars_B-sun_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mars_B-sun_opposition","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mars Opposition Sun', null, 'There can be a strong attraction between you, but it may come with just as much friction. The closer you get, the more likely you are to push against each other without meaning to. You may bring out each other''s competitive side, even in situations that have nothing to do with winning. You might feel like they are pushing for more than you are ready to give, while they might feel like they have to work harder than they should just to get close to you. The attraction is real, but it can sometimes feel like both of you are preparing for a challenge instead of settling into the connection.

At its best, this keeps the connection from going stale. This person may push you to say what you really think instead of keeping it to yourself. You may find yourself caring more, speaking up more, or paying closer attention because they have a way of getting a real response out of you. Even when they frustrate you, it can be hard to stay indifferent around them.

The harder part is that neither of you may realize how quickly the tension builds. What starts as a small disagreement can suddenly feel like a fight about something much bigger. One person pushes, the other pushes back, and before long you''re both focused on winning the moment instead of understanding each other. The attraction is still there, but it can get buried under the feeling that you always have to defend your position.

