nger is not a fight. It is a hard conversation that quietly never happens.\n\nUse what flows between you, and make something with it. Write, make art, dream out loud together, and then also have the boring conversation about money and logistics with the same care you give the beautiful ones. The connection is a gift, not a place to hide. It is fully itself when you bring the same depth to the difficult parts of life that you already bring to the lovely ones.","tension":"The risk is that it gets too comfortable to leave. You can build a shared world so lovely that ordinary life starts to feel like an interruption. When the bills come, when a real conflict surfaces, when something needs a plain practical decision, you both drift back toward the softer register instead. The connection pulls you toward the beautiful and the meaningful, never toward the dull and necessary, and a leaking faucet does not fix itself while you are busy being moved by a sunset. There is a subtler version of the same problem. The trine is good at the gentle feelings and clumsy with the ugly ones. Tenderness comes naturally. Anger, frustration, and plain disappointment do not, and it is easy to keep things poetic precisely when an unbeautiful truth needs saying. The danger is not a fight. It is a hard conversation that quietly never happens.","advice":"Use what flows between you, and make something with it. Write, make art, dream out loud together, and then also have the boring conversation about money and logistics with the same care you give the beautiful ones. The connection is a gift, not a place to hide. It is fully itself when you bring the same depth to the difficult parts of life that you already bring to the lovely ones.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":5}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-mercury_B-pluto_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"mercury","planetB":"pluto","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-mercury_B-pluto_conjunction', 'synastry-mercury-conjunction-pluto', 'relationship-mercury-conjunction-pluto']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-mercury_B-pluto_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-mercury_B-pluto_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Mercury Conjunction Pluto', null, 'This person has a way of reaching the thoughts beneath your thoughts. Mercury-Pluto conjunctions tend to create an immediate psychic charge in conversation. The Pluto person may seem to sense what the Mercury person means before it is fully spoken, picking up on subtext, silence, and the stories hiding between the lines. They often ask questions that cut straight to the heart of the matter, focusing on what is hidden, unresolved, or difficult to put into words.

At first, this can feel fascinating. The Mercury person may feel deeply heard, mentally challenged, and understood in a way that goes beyond ordinary conversation. The Pluto person often takes their words seriously and wants to know what is underneath them. This can create a rare kind of intellectual and psychological intimacy.

But this aspect can become overwhelming if healthy boundaries are not respected. Conversations may start to carry more emotional weight than either person realizes, even when discussing everyday topics. The Mercury person may begin to feel scrutinized or overly analyzed, while the Pluto person may feel a strong urge to keep digging for deeper answers. When one person pushes for vulnerability before the other is ready, genuine connection can start to feel like pressure instead of trust-building. At its worst, it can create mental control, obsession, interrogation, or a dynamic where one person feels constantly analyzed.

At its best, this aspect creates honest, transformative dialogue. It can help both people think more clearly, speak more truthfully, and uncover what has been hidden or avoided. The lesson is simple: truth does not need to be forced. A powerful conversation should leave both people clearer, not cornered.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person has a way of reaching the thoughts beneath your thoughts. Mercury-Pluto conjunctions tend to create an immediate psychic charge in conversation. The Pluto person may seem to sense what the Mercury person means before it is fully spoken, picking up on subtext, silence, and the stories hiding between the lines. They often ask questions that cut straight to the heart of the matter, focusing on what is hidden, unresolved, or difficult to put into words.\n\nAt first, this can feel fascinating. The Mercury person may feel deeply heard, mentally challenged, and understood in a way that goes beyond ordinary conversation. The Pluto person often takes their words seriously and wants to know what is underneath them. This can create a rare kind of intellectual and psychological intimacy.\n\nBut this aspect can become overwhelming if healthy boundaries are not respected. Conversations may start to carry more emotional weight than either person realizes, even when discussing everyday topics. The Mercury person may begin to feel scrutinized or overly analyzed, while the Pluto person may feel a strong urge to keep digging for deeper answers. When one person pushes for vulnerability before the other is ready, genuine connection can start to feel like pressure instead of trust-building. At its worst, it can create mental control, obsession, interrogation, or a dynamic where one person feels constantly analyzed.\n\nAt its best, this aspect creates honest, transformative dialogue. It can help both people think more clearly, speak more truthfully, and uncover what has been hidden or avoided. The lesson is simple: truth does not need to be forced. A powerful conversation should leave both people clearer, not cornered."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"But this aspect can become overwhelming if healthy boundaries are not respected. Conversations may start to carry more emotional weight than either person realizes, even when discussing everyday topics. The Mercury person may begin to feel scrutinized or overly analyzed, while the Pluto person may feel a strong urge to keep digging for deeper answers. When one person pushes for vulnerability before the other is ready, genuine connection can start to feel like pressure instead of trust-building. At its worst, it can create mental control, obsession, interrogation, or a dynamic where one person feels constantly analyzed."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"At its best, this aspect creates honest, transformative dialogue. It can help both people think more clearly, speak more truthfully, and uncover what has been hidden or avoided. The lesson is simple: truth does not need to be forced. A powerful conversation should leave both people clearer, not cornered."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-mercury_B-pluto_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s mind meets B''s depth and power. The conjunction fuses them - intense and inseparable.","summaryDeep":"This person has a way of reaching the thoughts beneath your thoughts. Mercury-Pluto conjunctions tend to create an immediate psychic charge in conversation. The Pluto person may seem to sense what the Mercury person means before it is fully spoken, picking up on subtext, silence, and the stories hiding between the lines. They often ask questions that cut straight to the heart of the matter, focusing on what is hidden, unresolved, or difficult to put into words.\n\nAt first, this can feel fascinating. The Mercury person may feel deeply heard, mentally challenged, and understood in a way that goes beyond ordinary conversation. The Pluto person often takes their words seriously and wants to know what is