  ('A-neptune_B-mercury_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"neptune","planetB":"mercury","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-neptune_B-mercury_trine', 'synastry-neptune-trine-mercury', 'relationship-neptune-trine-mercury']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-neptune_B-mercury_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-neptune_B-mercury_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Neptune Trine Mercury', null, 'Talking with this person can feel like slipping into a current that carries you both somewhere beyond language. There is an understanding between you that doesn''t rely on perfect explanations. Something in you recognizes something in them, and meaning moves between you in ways that words alone cannot account for.

The poetic comes easily here. You do not have to reach for it. You follow each other''s silences as well as each other''s sentences, read the mood, catch the unspoken thing, and feel met on more channels than language alone. This person makes it easy to say what you mean, and easy to say what you can barely put into words.

Some of the best moments between you are the quiet ones. Listening to something together without talking. Reading near each other and passing over a line that moved you. Sitting in a silence that does not need filling. That kind of closeness can run deeper than any conversation, and it tends to feel rare, like the two of you found a frequency most people never tune into.

The risk is that it gets too comfortable to leave. You can build a shared world so lovely that ordinary life starts to feel like an interruption. When the bills come, when a real conflict surfaces, when something needs a plain practical decision, you both drift back toward the softer register instead. The connection pulls you toward the beautiful and the meaningful, never toward the dull and necessary, and a leaking faucet does not fix itself while you are busy being moved by a sunset. There is a subtler version of the same problem. The trine is good at the gentle feelings and clumsy with the ugly ones. Tenderness comes naturally. Anger, frustration, and plain disappointment do not, and it is easy to keep things poetic precisely when an unbeautiful truth needs saying. The danger is not a fight. It is a hard conversation that quietly never happens.

Use what flows between you, and make something with it. Write, make art, dream out loud together, and then also have the boring conversation about money and logistics with the same care you give the beautiful ones. The connection is a gift, not a place to hide. It is fully itself when you bring the same depth to the difficult parts of life that you already bring to the lovely ones.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"Talking with this person can feel like slipping into a current that carries you both somewhere beyond language. There is an understanding between you that doesn''t rely on perfect explanations. Something in you recognizes something in them, and meaning moves between you in ways that words alone cannot account for.\n\nThe poetic comes easily here. You do not have to reach for it. You follow each other''s silences as well as each other''s sentences, read the mood, catch the unspoken thing, and feel met on more channels than language alone. This person makes it easy to say what you mean, and easy to say what you can barely put into words.\n\nSome of the best moments between you are the quiet ones. Listening to something together without talking. Reading near each other and passing over a line that moved you. Sitting in a silence that does not need filling. That kind of closeness can run deeper than any conversation, and it tends to feel rare, like the two of you found a frequency most people never tune into.\n\nThe risk is that it gets too comfortable to leave. You can build a shared world so lovely that ordinary life starts to feel like an interruption. When the bills come, when a real conflict surfaces, when something needs a plain practical decision, you both drift back toward the softer register instead. The connection pulls you toward the beautiful and the meaningful, never toward the dull and necessary, and a leaking faucet does not fix itself while you are busy being moved by a sunset. There is a subtler version of the same problem. The trine is good at the gentle feelings and clumsy with the ugly ones. Tenderness comes naturally. Anger, frustration, and plain disappointment do not, and it is easy to keep things poetic precisely when an unbeautiful truth needs saying. The danger is not a fight. It is a hard conversation that quietly never happens.\n\nUse what flows between you, and make something with it. Write, make art, dream out loud together, and then also have the boring conversation about money and logistics with the same care you give the beautiful ones. The connection is a gift, not a place to hide. It is fully itself when you bring the same depth to the difficult parts of life that you already bring to the lovely ones."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The risk is that it gets too comfortable to leave. You can build a shared world so lovely that ordinary life starts to feel like an interruption. When the bills come, when a real conflict surfaces, when something needs a plain practical decision, you both drift back toward the softer register instead. The connection pulls you toward the beautiful and the meaningful, never toward the dull and necessary, and a leaking faucet does not fix itself while you are busy being moved by a sunset. There is a subtler version of the same problem. The trine is good at the gentle feelings and clumsy with the ugly ones. Tenderness comes naturally. Anger, frustration, and plain disappointment do not, and it is easy to keep things poetic precisely when an unbeautiful truth needs saying. The danger is not a fight. It is a hard conversation that quietly never happens."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Use what flows between you, and make something with it. Write, make art, dream out loud together, and then also have the boring conversation about money and logistics with the same care you give the beautiful ones. The connection is a gift, not a place to hide. It is fully itself when you bring the same depth to the difficult parts of life that you already bring to the 