y have been real. But the story built around it may not have been.","advice":"The invitation here is to keep returning to what is actually happening. Notice where you are hoping, assuming, rescuing, or waiting for the other person to become clearer than they are willing to be. This connection can be beautiful when care and clarity are allowed to exist together. It hurts most when the dream of being understood becomes more important than the truth of who is actually there.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":5}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-neptune_B-moon_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"neptune","planetB":"moon","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-neptune_B-moon_sextile', 'synastry-neptune-sextile-moon', 'relationship-neptune-sextile-moon']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-neptune_B-moon_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-neptune_B-moon_sextile","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Neptune Sextile Moon', null, 'Some connections feel emotionally safe long before they become emotionally deep. This is often one of them.

The Neptune person may pick up on the Moon person''s moods and feelings in subtle ways, noticing what is going on beneath the surface without demanding an explanation. The Moon person, in turn, may find themselves opening up more naturally than they expected. There is often a sense of being listened to without being analyzed, understood without being pushed.

What makes this aspect special is that it allows trust to grow at its own pace. Neither person has to force intimacy or manufacture emotional closeness. Instead, it develops through small moments of understanding, thoughtful gestures, and the feeling that there is space for both people to be human. Over time, the relationship can become a source of genuine comfort and support.

There is a softness here that can bring out the best in both people. The Moon person may feel safer expressing vulnerability, while the Neptune person may discover that caring for someone does not require sacrificing themselves. Together, they can create an atmosphere of patience, empathy, and emotional generosity.

The difficulty is that this connection can sometimes stay in the realm of potential. Both people may sense what the other is feeling without ever talking about it directly. Important needs can remain implied rather than expressed. The relationship may feel warm and supportive, yet avoid the conversations that would allow it to deepen further.

This aspect works best when intuition is paired with honesty. Trust what you sense, but also say what you mean. The compassion between you is real, but it becomes much more meaningful when it is supported by clear communication. The gift here is not saving each other. It is creating a relationship where both people feel understood, cared for, and free to remain themselves.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"Some connections feel emotionally safe long before they become emotionally deep. This is often one of them.\n\nThe Neptune person may pick up on the Moon person''s moods and feelings in subtle ways, noticing what is going on beneath the surface without demanding an explanation. The Moon person, in turn, may find themselves opening up more naturally than they expected. There is often a sense of being listened to without being analyzed, understood without being pushed.\n\nWhat makes this aspect special is that it allows trust to grow at its own pace. Neither person has to force intimacy or manufacture emotional closeness. Instead, it develops through small moments of understanding, thoughtful gestures, and the feeling that there is space for both people to be human. Over time, the relationship can become a source of genuine comfort and support.\n\nThere is a softness here that can bring out the best in both people. The Moon person may feel safer expressing vulnerability, while the Neptune person may discover that caring for someone does not require sacrificing themselves. Together, they can create an atmosphere of patience, empathy, and emotional generosity.\n\nThe difficulty is that this connection can sometimes stay in the realm of potential. Both people may sense what the other is feeling without ever talking about it directly. Important needs can remain implied rather than expressed. The relationship may feel warm and supportive, yet avoid the conversations that would allow it to deepen further.\n\nThis aspect works best when intuition is paired with honesty. Trust what you sense, but also say what you mean. The compassion between you is real, but it becomes much more meaningful when it is supported by clear communication. The gift here is not saving each other. It is creating a relationship where both people feel understood, cared for, and free to remain themselves."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The difficulty is that this connection can sometimes stay in the realm of potential. Both people may sense what the other is feeling without ever talking about it directly. Important needs can remain implied rather than expressed. The relationship may feel warm and supportive, yet avoid the conversations that would allow it to deepen further."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"This aspect works best when intuition is paired with honesty. Trust what you sense, but also say what you mean. The compassion between you is real, but it becomes much more meaningful when it is supported by clear communication. The gift here is not saving each other. It is creating a relationship where both people feel understood, cared for, and free to remain themselves."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-neptune_B-moon_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s dreams meets B''s feelings. The sextile supports them, if you act on it.","summaryDeep":"Some connections feel emotionally safe long before they become emotionally deep. This is often one of them.\n\nThe Neptune person may pick up on the Moon person''s moods and feelings in subtle ways, noticing what is going on beneath the surface without demanding an explanation. The Moon person, in turn, may find themselves opening up more naturally than they expected. There is often a sense of being listened to without being analyzed, understood without being pushed.\n\nWhat makes this aspect special is that it allows trust to grow at its own pace. Neither person has to force intimacy or manufacture emotional closeness. Instead, it develops through small moments of understanding, thoughtful gestur