lity arrives and asks to be included. This connection can be deeply beautiful when both people allow room for mystery without abandoning truth.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":5}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-neptune_B-sun_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"neptune","planetB":"sun","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-neptune_B-sun_sextile', 'synastry-neptune-sextile-sun', 'relationship-neptune-sextile-sun']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-neptune_B-sun_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-neptune_B-sun_sextile","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Neptune Sextile Sun', null, 'This connection often begins quietly.

The Neptune person may notice something in the Sun person that others overlook. Not necessarily what the Sun person is today, but who they are becoming. They may sense a hidden talent, a forgotten dream, or a gentler version of the Sun person waiting beneath old defenses. Their faith can feel encouraging rather than overwhelming, as though they are simply holding a light toward something that already exists.

The Sun person, in turn, may feel drawn toward parts of themselves they do not usually make time for. Around the Neptune person, life can seem a little less rigid, a little less defined by practical concerns. There is often a feeling that not everything meaningful needs to be explained or proven.

Because this is a sextile, the magic tends to unfold through choice rather than fate. The connection offers opportunities for creativity, compassion, healing, and emotional openness, but neither person is pushed into them. They have to participate. They have to decide to meet each other there.

When they do, the relationship can become a source of quiet inspiration. The Neptune person helps the Sun person trust their imagination. The Sun person helps the Neptune person bring their visions into the world. What is dreamed can become lived. The challenge is subtle. It is easy to enjoy the feeling of possibility without ever asking where it is leading. Plans can remain ideas. Feelings can remain implied. Both people may assume they understand each other without taking the time to make things clear.

The lesson is not to abandon the dream. It is to give it a place to land. This aspect is at its best when inspiration is paired with honesty, when kindness is paired with clarity, and when both people allow themselves to be seen not only for who they could become, but for who they already are.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This connection often begins quietly.\n\nThe Neptune person may notice something in the Sun person that others overlook. Not necessarily what the Sun person is today, but who they are becoming. They may sense a hidden talent, a forgotten dream, or a gentler version of the Sun person waiting beneath old defenses. Their faith can feel encouraging rather than overwhelming, as though they are simply holding a light toward something that already exists.\n\nThe Sun person, in turn, may feel drawn toward parts of themselves they do not usually make time for. Around the Neptune person, life can seem a little less rigid, a little less defined by practical concerns. There is often a feeling that not everything meaningful needs to be explained or proven.\n\nBecause this is a sextile, the magic tends to unfold through choice rather than fate. The connection offers opportunities for creativity, compassion, healing, and emotional openness, but neither person is pushed into them. They have to participate. They have to decide to meet each other there.\n\nWhen they do, the relationship can become a source of quiet inspiration. The Neptune person helps the Sun person trust their imagination. The Sun person helps the Neptune person bring their visions into the world. What is dreamed can become lived. The challenge is subtle. It is easy to enjoy the feeling of possibility without ever asking where it is leading. Plans can remain ideas. Feelings can remain implied. Both people may assume they understand each other without taking the time to make things clear.\n\nThe lesson is not to abandon the dream. It is to give it a place to land. This aspect is at its best when inspiration is paired with honesty, when kindness is paired with clarity, and when both people allow themselves to be seen not only for who they could become, but for who they already are."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"When they do, the relationship can become a source of quiet inspiration. The Neptune person helps the Sun person trust their imagination. The Sun person helps the Neptune person bring their visions into the world. What is dreamed can become lived. The challenge is subtle. It is easy to enjoy the feeling of possibility without ever asking where it is leading. Plans can remain ideas. Feelings can remain implied. Both people may assume they understand each other without taking the time to make things clear."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"The lesson is not to abandon the dream. It is to give it a place to land. This aspect is at its best when inspiration is paired with honesty, when kindness is paired with clarity, and when both people allow themselves to be seen not only for who they could become, but for who they already are."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-neptune_B-sun_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s dreams meets B''s identity. The sextile supports them, if you act on it.","summaryDeep":"This connection often begins quietly.\n\nThe Neptune person may notice something in the Sun person that others overlook. Not necessarily what the Sun person is today, but who they are becoming. They may sense a hidden talent, a forgotten dream, or a gentler version of the Sun person waiting beneath old defenses. Their faith can feel encouraging rather than overwhelming, as though they are simply holding a light toward something that already exists.\n\nThe Sun person, in turn, may feel drawn toward parts of themselves they do not usually make time for. Around the Neptune person, life can seem a little less rigid, a little less defined by practical concerns. There is often a feeling that not everything meaningful needs to be explained 