e this aspect can deliver on its promise.","tension":"Even in a harmonious aspect like this, Neptune can make things a little blurry around the edges. Because being together feels so natural, it''s easy to gloss over the small moments when you''re not seeing each other quite clearly. The Sun person may enjoy being admired and believed in. The Neptune person may prefer the version of the relationship that feels beautiful rather than asking harder questions about what''s actually there. Nothing dramatic has to happen for this to become a problem. Sometimes it''s just a tendency to let things slide, to avoid uncomfortable conversations, or to assume everything is fine because the connection feels good. Over time, those unspoken realities can quietly build up in the background.","advice":"The key is to enjoy the magic without losing touch with what''s real. Let the relationship inspire you, but stay honest about who you are and who the other person is. The more clearly you see each other, the more this aspect can deliver on its promise.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":5}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
