to its orbit than you realize. Power this comfortable can still quietly organize your life around it.","advice":"Use the energy on purpose, and keep your own footing as you do. This is the rare Mars-Pluto contact that mostly empowers rather than destabilizes. The work is channeling the intensity into what you actually want, rather than letting it run the show.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":5}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-pluto_B-mercury_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"pluto","planetB":"mercury","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-pluto_B-mercury_conjunction', 'synastry-pluto-conjunction-mercury', 'relationship-pluto-conjunction-mercury']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-pluto_B-mercury_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-pluto_B-mercury_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Pluto Conjunction Mercury', null, 'This person has a way of reaching the thoughts beneath your thoughts. Mercury-Pluto conjunctions tend to create an immediate psychic charge in conversation. The Pluto person may seem to sense what the Mercury person means before it is fully spoken, picking up on subtext, silence, and the stories hiding between the lines. They often ask questions that cut straight to the heart of the matter, focusing on what is hidden, unresolved, or difficult to put into words.

At first, this can feel fascinating. The Mercury person may feel deeply heard, mentally challenged, and understood in a way that goes beyond ordinary conversation. The Pluto person often takes their words seriously and wants to know what is underneath them. This can create a rare kind of intellectual and psychological intimacy.

But this aspect can become overwhelming if healthy boundaries are not respected. Conversations may start to carry more emotional weight than either person realizes, even when discussing everyday topics. The Mercury person may begin to feel scrutinized or overly analyzed, while the Pluto person may feel a strong urge to keep digging for deeper answers. When one person pushes for vulnerability before the other is ready, genuine connection can start to feel like pressure instead of trust-building. At its worst, it can create mental control, obsession, interrogation, or a dynamic where one person feels constantly analyzed.

At its best, this aspect creates honest, transformative dialogue. It can help both people think more clearly, speak more truthfully, and uncover what has been hidden or avoided. The lesson is simple: truth does not need to be forced. A powerful conversation should leave both people clearer, not cornered.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person has a way of reaching the thoughts beneath your thoughts. Mercury-Pluto conjunctions tend to create an immediate psychic charge in conversation. The Pluto person may seem to sense what the Mercury person means before it is fully spoken, picking up on subtext, silence, and the stories hiding between the lines. They often ask questions that cut straight to the heart of the matter, focusing on what is hidden, unresolved, or difficult to put into words.\n\nAt first, this can feel fascinating. The Mercury person may feel deeply heard, mentally challenged, and understood in a way that goes beyond ordinary conversation. The Pluto person often takes their words seriously and wants to know what is underneath them. This can create a rare kind of intellectual and psychological intimacy.\n\nBut this aspect can become overwhelming if healthy boundaries are not respected. Conversations may start to carry more emotional weight than either person realizes, even when discussing everyday topics. The Mercury person may begin to feel scrutinized or overly analyzed, while the Pluto person may feel a strong urge to keep digging for deeper answers. When one person pushes for vulnerability before the other is ready, genuine connection can start to feel like pressure instead of trust-building. At its worst, it can create mental control, obsession, interrogation, or a dynamic where one person feels constantly analyzed.\n\nAt its best, this aspect creates honest, transformative dialogue. It can help both people think more clearly, speak more truthfully, and uncover what has been hidden or avoided. The lesson is simple: truth does not need to be forced. A powerful conversation should leave both people clearer, not cornered."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"But this aspect can become overwhelming if healthy boundaries are not respected. Conversations may start to carry more emotional weight than either person realizes, even when discussing everyday topics. The Mercury person may begin to feel scrutinized or overly analyzed, while the Pluto person may feel a strong urge to keep digging for deeper answers. When one person pushes for vulnerability before the other is ready, genuine connection can start to feel like pressure instead of trust-building. At its worst, it can create mental control, obsession, interrogation, or a dynamic where one person feels constantly analyzed."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"At its best, this aspect creates honest, transformative dialogue. It can help both people think more clearly, speak more truthfully, and uncover what has been hidden or avoided. The lesson is simple: truth does not need to be forced. A powerful conversation should leave both people clearer, not cornered."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-pluto_B-mercury_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s depth and power meets B''s mind. The conjunction fuses them - intense and inseparable.","summaryDeep":"This person has a way of reaching the thoughts beneath your thoughts. Mercury-Pluto conjunctions tend to create an immediate psychic charge in conversation. The Pluto person may seem to sense what the Mercury person means before it is fully spoken, picking up on subtext, silence, and the stories hiding between the lines. They often ask questions that cut straight to the heart of the matter, focusing on what is hidden, unresolved, or difficult to put into words.\n\nAt first, this can feel fascinating. The Mercury person may feel deeply heard, mentally challenged, and understood in a way that goes beyond ordinary conversation. The Pluto person often takes their words seriously and wants to know what is