th is built one step at a time.","tension":"The main challenge is overlooking the value of something that feels stable and predictable. If you are used to relationships that run on excitement or uncertainty, you may not immediately recognize how powerful consistency can be.","advice":"Appreciate the people who help you stay aligned with your goals and values. Lasting growth often comes from steady support, not dramatic moments. This connection reminds you that real strength is built one step at a time.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
