their own insecurities, this aspect can become a turning point rather than a reason for separation.","advice":"If someone struggles to give affection, reassurance, or emotional presence, that tells you something about them. It does not automatically tell you something about your value. Too many people stay stuck here, working harder and harder to earn what should be given freely in a healthy relationship. Take the insight this connection offers.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-saturn_B-venus_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"saturn","planetB":"venus","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-saturn_B-venus_trine', 'synastry-saturn-trine-venus', 'relationship-saturn-trine-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-saturn_B-venus_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-saturn_B-venus_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Saturn Trine Venus', null, 'This person can help bring steadiness into your life. They may express care through consistency, reliability, and practical support rather than grand gestures. Over time, their presence can create a sense of trust that feels earned, grounded, and real.

When this connection is working well, the relationship offers stability without demanding that you sacrifice yourself for it. This person may encourage you to take your values seriously, honor your commitments, and recognize your own worth. Their support can help you feel more rooted in what matters and more confident in your ability to build something lasting.

One of the gifts of this aspect is that trust grows through follow-through. Intimacy deepens when people respect each other''s boundaries and show up for one another in meaningful ways. This person may teach you that security is not the opposite of connection. Sometimes it is the very thing that allows connection to deepen.

The challenge is becoming so focused on responsibility that the relationship loses warmth or flexibility. It can be easy to prioritize obligations, routines, or long-term goals while neglecting enjoyment, appreciation, or emotional connection.

The healthiest expression of this aspect balances stability with genuine care. Strong relationships need reliability, but they also need moments of appreciation, openness, and shared enjoyment. When both are present, this connection can become a lasting source of support and growth.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person can help bring steadiness into your life. They may express care through consistency, reliability, and practical support rather than grand gestures. Over time, their presence can create a sense of trust that feels earned, grounded, and real.\n\nWhen this connection is working well, the relationship offers stability without demanding that you sacrifice yourself for it. This person may encourage you to take your values seriously, honor your commitments, and recognize your own worth. Their support can help you feel more rooted in what matters and more confident in your ability to build something lasting.\n\nOne of the gifts of this aspect is that trust grows through follow-through. Intimacy deepens when people respect each other''s boundaries and show up for one another in meaningful ways. This person may teach you that security is not the opposite of connection. Sometimes it is the very thing that allows connection to deepen.\n\nThe challenge is becoming so focused on responsibility that the relationship loses warmth or flexibility. It can be easy to prioritize obligations, routines, or long-term goals while neglecting enjoyment, appreciation, or emotional connection.\n\nThe healthiest expression of this aspect balances stability with genuine care. Strong relationships need reliability, but they also need moments of appreciation, openness, and shared enjoyment. When both are present, this connection can become a lasting source of support and growth."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is becoming so focused on responsibility that the relationship loses warmth or flexibility. It can be easy to prioritize obligations, routines, or long-term goals while neglecting enjoyment, appreciation, or emotional connection."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"The healthiest expression of this aspect balances stability with genuine care. Strong relationships need reliability, but they also need moments of appreciation, openness, and shared enjoyment. When both are present, this connection can become a lasting source of support and growth."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-saturn_B-venus_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"The Saturn person and Venus person can build reliable affection without much strain. Loyalty feels natural. Keep pleasure alive, because this contact can become practical enough to forget delight.","summaryDeep":"This person can help bring steadiness into your life. They may express care through consistency, reliability, and practical support rather than grand gestures. Over time, their presence can create a sense of trust that feels earned, grounded, and real.\n\nWhen this connection is working well, the relationship offers stability without demanding that you sacrifice yourself for it. This person may encourage you to take your values seriously, honor your commitments, and recognize your own worth. Their support can help you feel more rooted in what matters and more confident in your ability to build something lasting.\n\nOne of the gifts of this aspect is that trust grows through follow-through. Intimacy deepens when people respect each other''s boundaries and show up for one another in meaningful ways. This person may teach you that security is not the opposite of connection. Sometimes it is the very thing that allows connection to deepen.\n\nThe challenge is becoming so focused on responsibility that the relationship loses warmth or flexibility. It can be easy to prioritize obligations, routines, or long-term goals while neglecting enjoyment, appreciation, or emotional connection.\n\nThe healthiest expression of this aspect balances stability with genuine care. Strong relationships need reliability, but they also need moments of appreciation, openness, and shared enjoyment. When both are present, this connection can become a lasting source of support and growth.","tension":"The challenge is becoming so focused on responsibility that the relationship loses warmth or flexibility. It can be easy to prioritize obligations, routines, or long-term goals while neglecting enjoyment, appreciation, or emotional connection.","advice":"The healthiest expression of this aspect balances stability with genuine care. Strong relationships need reliability, but they also need moments of appreciation, openness, and shared enjoyment. When both are present, this connection can become a lasting source of support and growth.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-jupiter_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"jupiter","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-jupiter_conjunction', 'synastry-sun-conjunction-jupiter', 'relationship-sun-conjunction-jupiter']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-jupiter_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-jupiter_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Conjunction Jupiter', null, 'This person may bring out your confidence and remind you of what you are capable of achieving.

They often have a way of noticing what you are capable of, especially in moments when you have lost sight of it yourself. Their confidence in you can make it easier to trust your own direction, and being around them may leave you feeling more willing to reach for something larger than what you thought was available to you.

When this works well, being around this person can make it easier to trust your own growth. They have a way of reflecting back your strengths when you lose sight of them and reminding you that the future is still being written. Their belief in what is possible for you can help you reconnect with possibilities you had quietly set aside.

One of the greatest gifts of this connection is perspective. When self-doubt creeps in, they may remind you of how far you have come, what you have already accomplished, and what resources you have available to move forward.

The challenge is making sure encouragement is paired with accountability. Big dreams still require planning, consistency, and follow-through. It can be easy to focus on potential while overlooking the habits, skills, and effort needed to turn that potential into results.

Use their belief in you as fuel, not as a substitute for action. The most successful expression of this connection happens when optimism is matched with commitment and inspiration is translated into meaningful progress.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person may bring out your confidence and remind you of what you are capable of achieving.\n\nThey often have a way of noticing what you are capable of, especially in moments when you have lost sight of it yourself. Their confidence in you can make it easier to trust your own direction, and being around them may leave you feeling more willing to reach for something larger than what you thought was available to you.\n\nWhen this works well, being around this person can make it easier to trust your own growth. They have a way of reflecting back your strengths when you lose sight of them and reminding you that the future is still being written. Their belief in what is possible for you can help you reconnect with possibilities you had quietly set aside.\n\nOne of the greatest gifts of this connection is perspective. When self-doubt creeps in, they may remind you of how far you have come, what you have already accomplished, and what resources you have available to move forward.\n\nThe challenge is making sure encouragement is paired with accountability. Big dreams still require planning, consistency, and follow-through. It can be easy to focus on potential while overlooking the habits, skills, and effort needed to turn that potential into results.\n\nUse their belief in you as fuel, not as a substitute for action. The most successful expression of this connection happens when optimism is matched with commitment and inspiration is translated into meaningful progress."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is making sure encouragement is paired with accountability. Big dreams still require planning, consistency, and follow-through. It can be easy to focus on potential while overlooking the habits, skills, and effort needed to turn that potential into results."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Use their belief in you as fuel, not as a substitute for action. The most successful expression of this connection happens when optimism is matched with commitment and inspiration is translated into meaningful progress."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-jupiter_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s identity meets B''s growth. The conjunction fuses them - intense and inseparable.","summaryDeep":"This person may bring out your confidence and remind you of what you are capable of achieving.\n\nThey often have a way of noticing what you are capable of, especially in moments when you have lost sight of it yourself. Their confidence in you can make it easier to trust your own direction, and being around them may leave you feeling more willing to reach for something larger than what you thought was available to you.\n\nWhen this works well, being around this person can make it easier to trust your own growth. They have a way of reflecting back your strengths when you lose sight of them and reminding you that the future is still being written. Their belief in what is possible for you can help you reconnect with possibilities you had quietly set aside.\n\nOne of the greatest gifts of this connection is perspective. When self-doubt creeps in, they may remind you of how far you have come, what you have already accomplished, and what resources you have available to move forward.\n\nThe challenge is making sure encouragement is paired with accountability. Big dreams still require planning, consistency, and follow-through. It can be easy to focus on potential while overlooking the habits, skills, and effort needed to turn that potential into results.\n\nUse their belief in you as fuel, not as a substitute for action. The most successful expression of this connection happens when optimism is matched with commitment and inspiration is translated into meaningful progress.","tension":"The challenge is making sure encouragement is paired with accountability. Big dreams still require planning, consistency, and follow-through. It can be easy to focus on potential while overlooking the habits, skills, and effort needed to turn that potential into results.","advice":"Use their belief in you as fuel, not as a substitute for action. The most successful expression of this connection happens when optimism is matched with commitment and inspiration is translated into meaningful progress.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-jupiter_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"jupiter","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-jupiter_opposition', 'synastry-sun-opposition-jupiter', 'relationship-sun-opposition-jupiter']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-jupiter_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-jupiter_opposition","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Opposition Jupiter', null, 'This person may challenge you to think bigger about what is possible for your life, career, or future.

They often see opportunities where you see obstacles. They may encourage you to aim higher, take a calculated risk, or pursue goals that feel just beyond your current comfort zone. Their confidence in your potential can be motivating, but it can also feel intimidating if you''re focused on the practical realities of getting there.

When this dynamic is working well, you help each other grow. They push you to expand your vision and stop limiting yourself based on old assumptions. You help them turn big ideas into actionable plans. One person brings ambition and possibility; the other brings strategy and perspective. Together, you can balance inspiration with execution.

The opportunity here is learning that growth requires both vision and realism. Their optimism can help you see opportunities you might otherwise overlook. Your careful thinking can help ensure those opportunities are sustainable and achievable.

The challenge comes when encouragement starts to feel like pressure or when caution is mistaken for resistance. They may wonder why you''re not moving faster. You may wonder whether they''ve fully considered the risks. Conversations about goals, timing, or next steps can become debates about what is actually realistic.

The key is to use their belief in your potential as fuel, not as a substitute for your own decision-making. Let them expand your perspective while staying connected to your values, priorities, and plan. The strongest version of this connection combines bold vision with thoughtful execution.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person may challenge you to think bigger about what is possible for your life, career, or future.\n\nThey often see opportunities where you see obstacles. They may encourage you to aim higher, take a calculated risk, or pursue goals that feel just beyond your current comfort zone. Their confidence in your potential can be motivating, but it can also feel intimidating if you''re focused on the practical realities of getting there.\n\nWhen this dynamic is working well, you help each other grow. They push you to expand your vision and stop limiting yourself based on old assumptions. You help them turn big ideas into actionable plans. One person brings ambition and possibility; the other brings strategy and perspective. Together, you can balance inspiration with execution.\n\nThe opportunity here is learning that growth requires both vision and realism. Their optimism can help you see opportunities you might otherwise overlook. Your careful thinking can help ensure those opportunities are sustainable and achievable.\n\nThe challenge comes when encouragement starts to feel like pressure or when caution is mistaken for resistance. They may wonder why you''re not moving faster. You may wonder whether they''ve fully considered the risks. Conversations about goals, timing, or next steps can become debates about what is actually realistic.\n\nThe key is to use their belief in your potential as fuel, not as a substitute for your own decision-making. Let them expand your perspective while staying connected to your values, priorities, and plan. The strongest version of this connection combines bold vision with thoughtful execution."},{"he