gful the connection feels. What starts as easy communication can grow into something deeper: the feeling that someone truly sees you and wants to know you more.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":3}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-mercury_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"mercury","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-mercury_square', 'synastry-sun-square-mercury', 'relationship-sun-square-mercury']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-mercury_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-mercury_square","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Square Mercury', null, 'This person may misunderstand you in a way that gets under your skin. The tension isn''t necessarily about what is being said. It''s about the gap between what is meant and what is received. This person may reflect something back to you that feels slightly off. They may think they understand your intentions while missing an important piece of your experience. You may find yourself repeating, clarifying, or trying to find new language for something that feels obvious from your side.

That can be exhausting. It can also be revealing.

Squares ask us to work. They shine a light on patterns that may be holding you back from deeper connection. In this relationship, misunderstandings can become opportunities for growth. You may be encouraged to communicate more clearly and express what you truly mean, rather than assuming the other person already knows. They may be encouraged to slow down, stay curious, and listen with an open mind before jumping to conclusions.

When the tension builds, conversations can turn into arguments about who understands the situation better. One person feels unseen. The other feels like their efforts are being dismissed. Instead of getting curious, both people may become defensive.

The growth here comes from slowing down. Not by accepting being misunderstood, but by staying in the conversation long enough to understand each other more clearly. This connection isn''t really about proving who''s right. It''s about both of you getting better at seeing each other for who you actually are, instead of getting stuck in your own assumptions about each other.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person may misunderstand you in a way that gets under your skin. The tension isn''t necessarily about what is being said. It''s about the gap between what is meant and what is received. This person may reflect something back to you that feels slightly off. They may think they understand your intentions while missing an important piece of your experience. You may find yourself repeating, clarifying, or trying to find new language for something that feels obvious from your side.\n\nThat can be exhausting. It can also be revealing.\n\nSquares ask us to work. They shine a light on patterns that may be holding you back from deeper connection. In this relationship, misunderstandings can become opportunities for growth. You may be encouraged to communicate more clearly and express what you truly mean, rather than assuming the other person already knows. They may be encouraged to slow down, stay curious, and listen with an open mind before jumping to conclusions.\n\nWhen the tension builds, conversations can turn into arguments about who understands the situation better. One person feels unseen. The other feels like their efforts are being dismissed. Instead of getting curious, both people may become defensive.\n\nThe growth here comes from slowing down. Not by accepting being misunderstood, but by staying in the conversation long enough to understand each other more clearly. This connection isn''t really about proving who''s right. It''s about both of you getting better at seeing each other for who you actually are, instead of getting stuck in your own assumptions about each other."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"When the tension builds, conversations can turn into arguments about who understands the situation better. One person feels unseen. The other feels like their efforts are being dismissed. Instead of getting curious, both people may become defensive."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"The growth here comes from slowing down. Not by accepting being misunderstood, but by staying in the conversation long enough to understand each other more clearly. This connection isn''t really about proving who''s right. It''s about both of you getting better at seeing each other for who you actually are, instead of getting stuck in your own assumptions about each other."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-mercury_square","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s identity meets B''s mind. The square puts them in friction.","summaryDeep":"This person may misunderstand you in a way that gets under your skin. The tension isn''t necessarily about what is being said. It''s about the gap between what is meant and what is received. This person may reflect something back to you that feels slightly off. They may think they understand your intentions while missing an important piece of your experience. You may find yourself repeating, clarifying, or trying to find new language for something that feels obvious from your side.\n\nThat can be exhausting. It can also be revealing.\n\nSquares ask us to work. They shine a light on patterns that may be holding you back from deeper connection. In this relationship, misunderstandings can become opportunities for growth. You may be encouraged to communicate more clearly and express what you truly mean, rather than assuming the other person already knows. They may be encouraged to slow down, stay curious, and listen with an open mind before jumping to conclusions.\n\nWhen the tension builds, conversations can turn into arguments about who understands the situation better. One person feels unseen. The other feels like their efforts are being dismissed. Instead of getting curious, both people may become defensive.\n\nThe growth here comes from slowing down. Not by accepting being misunderstood, but by staying in the conversation long enough to understand each other more clearly. This connection isn''t really about proving who''s right. It''s about both of you getting better at seeing each other for who you actually are, instead of getting stuck in your own assumptions about each other.","tension":"When the tension builds, conversations can turn into arguments about who understands the situation better. One person feels unseen. The other feels like their efforts are being dismissed. Instead of getting curious, both people may become defensive.","advice":"The growth here comes from slowing down. Not by accepting being misunderstood, but by staying in the conversation long enough to understand each other more clearly. This connection isn''t really about proving who''s right. It''s about both of you getting better at seeing each other for who you actually are, instead of getting stuck in your own assumptions about each other.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":3}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-mercury_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"mercury","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-mercury_trine', 'synastry-sun-trine-mercury', 'relationship-sun-trine-mercury']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-mercury_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-mercury_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Trine Mercury', null, 'There is often an ease between the way you express who you are and the way this person listens, understands, and responds. You may feel less guarded around them. Less concerned with finding the perfect words. More able to trust that what you mean will actually land.

Their attention can feel affirming. Not because they agree with everything you say, but because they seem genuinely interested in understanding you. They may remember the details that matter, reflect your thoughts back with care, or help you articulate something that was still taking shape inside of you.

When this connection is flowing, conversation becomes a place of recognition. You may feel witnessed in ways that help you settle more fully into yourself. There can be a quiet confidence that grows from being understood without having to constantly explain or defend who you are.

Still, every gift asks something of us. The ease here can make it tempting to assume that understanding will always be available. You may stop sharing the parts of yourself that are changing. They may rely on what they already know instead of staying curious about who you are becoming.

This connection works best when both people stay engaged. Do not assume you already know each other. Keep sharing what is changing in your life. The understanding between you is a strength, and it keeps growing when you both stay informed.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There is often an ease between the way you express who you are and the way this person listens, understands, and responds. You may feel less guarded around them. Less concerned with finding the perfect words. More able to trust that what you mean will actually land.\n\nTheir attention can feel affirming. Not because they agree with everything you say, but because they seem genuinely interested in understanding you. They may remember the details that matter, reflect your thoughts back with care, or help you articulate something that was still taking shape inside of you.\n\nWhen this connection is flowing, conversation becomes a place of recognition. You may feel witnessed in ways that help you settle more fully into yourself. There can be a quiet confidence that grows from being understood without having to constantly explain or defend who you are.\n\nStill, every gift asks something of us. The ease here can make it tempting to assume that understanding will always be available. You may stop sharing the parts of yourself that are changing. They may rely on what they already know instead of staying curious about who you are becoming.\n\nThis connection works best when both people stay engaged. Do not assume you already know each other. Keep sharing what is changing in your life. The understanding between you is a strength, and it keeps growing when you both stay informed."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"Still, every gift asks something of us. The ease here can make it tempting to assume that understanding will always be available. You may stop sharing the parts of yourself that are changing. They may rely on what they already know instead of staying curious about who you are becoming."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"This connection works best when both people stay engaged. Do not assume you already know each other. Keep sharing what is changing in your life. The understanding between you is a strength, and it keeps growing when you both stay informed."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-mercury_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s identity meets B''s mind. The trine lets them flow together easily.","summaryDeep":"There is often an ease between the way you express who you are and the way this person listens, understands, and responds. You may feel less guarded around them. Less concerned with finding the perfect words. More able to trust that what you mean will actually land.\n\nTheir attention can feel affirming. Not because they agree with everything you say, but because they seem genuinely interested in understanding you. They may remember the details that matter, reflect your thoughts back with care, or help you articulate something that was still taking shape inside of you.\n\nWhen this connection is flowing, conversation becomes a place of recognition. You may feel witnessed in ways that help you settle more fully into yourself. There can be a quiet confidence that grows from being understood without having to constantly explain or defend who you are.\n\nStill, every gift asks something of us. The ease here can make it tempting to assume that understanding will always be available. You may stop sharing the parts of yourself that are changing. They may rely on what they already know instead of staying curious about who you are becoming.\n\nThis connection works best when both people stay engaged. Do not assume you already know each other. Keep sharing what is changing in your life. The understanding between you is a strength, and it keeps growing when you both stay informed.","tension":"Still, every gift asks something of us. The ease here can make it tempting to assume that understanding will always be available. You may stop sharing the parts of yourself that are changing. They may rely on what they already know instead of staying curious about who you are becoming.","advice":"This connection works best when both people stay engaged. Do not assume you already know each other. Keep sharing what is changing in your life. The understanding between you is a strength, and it keeps growing when you both stay informed.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":3}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-moon_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"moon","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-moon_conjunction', 'synastry-sun-conjunction-moon', 'relationship-sun-conjunction-moon']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-moon_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-moon_conjunction","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Conjunction Moon', 'This can feel familiar right away. One person''s personality fits easily with the other person''s emotional needs, so being around each other may feel natural without either of you doing much.', 'This can feel familiar right away. One person''s personality fits easily with the other person''s emotional needs, so being around each other may feel natural without either of you doing much.

There''s a real comfort here. One person may feel seen, and the other may feel needed in a way that actually feels good. It''s not always dramatic or flashy. It''s more like, "Oh, I can relax around you."

The problem is that comfort can turn into dependence. One person may start expecting the other to always be their soft place to land, and the relationship can get a little too comfortable without anyone noticing.

Enjoy the closeness, but don''t disappear into it. This works best when both people still have their own life.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This can feel familiar right away. One person''s personality fits easily with the other person''s emotional needs, so being around each other may feel natural without either of you doing much.\n\nThere''s a real comfort here. One person may feel seen, and the other may feel needed in a way that actually feels good. It''s not always dramatic or flashy. It''s more like, \"Oh, I can relax around you.\"\n\nThe problem is that comfort can turn into dependence. One person may start expecting the other to always be their soft place to land, and the relationship can get a little too comfortable without anyone noticing.\n\nEnjoy the closeness, but don''t disappear into it. This works best when both people still have their own life."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The problem is that comfort can turn into dependence. One person may start expecting the other to always be their soft place to land, and the relationship can get a little too comfortable without anyone noticing."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Enjoy the closeness, but don''t disappear into it. This works best when both people still have their own life."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-moon_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Wants and needs run as one instinct. The Sun person''s drive and the Moon person''s feelings fold together - you get each other at a level that''s hard to explain. Strong foundational glue. Failure mode: coasting on the ease and never building anything with it. Use the natural understanding to make something; don''t treat it as the whole relationship.","summaryDeep":"This can feel familiar right away. One person''s personality fits easily with the other person''s emotional needs, so being around each other may feel natural without either of you doing much.\n\nThere''s a real comfort here. One person may feel seen, and the other may feel needed in a way that actually feels good. It''s not always dramatic or flashy. It''s more like, \"Oh, I can relax around you.\"\n\nThe problem is that comfort can turn into dependence. One person may start expecting the other to always be their soft place to land, and the relationship can get a little too comfortable without anyone noticing.\n\nEnjoy the closeness, but don''t disappear into it. This works best when both people still have their own life.","tension":"The problem is that comfort can turn into dependence. One person may start expecting the other to always be their soft place to land, and the relationship can get a little too comfortable without anyone noticing.","advice":"Enjoy the closeness, but don''t disappear into it. This works best when both people still have their own life.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-moon_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"moon","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-moon_opposition', 'synastry-sun-opposition-moon', 'relationship-sun-opposition-moon']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-moon_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-moon_opposition","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Opposition Moon', 'There''s a strong pull here, but you may not always feel like you''re coming from the same place. One person''s way of being can bring up a lot of feelings in the other person, sometimes in a good way, sometimes in a "why am I reacting like this?" way.', 'There''s a strong pull here, but you may not always feel like you''re coming from the same place. One person''s way of being can bring up a lot of feelings in the other person, sometimes in a good way, sometimes in a "why am I reacting like this?" way.

At its best, you balance each other out. One person brings direction, confidence, or clarity. The other brings care, sensitivity, and emotional reality. You may feel like this person has something you need, even when they also get on your nerves.

The problem is that it can turn into a standoff. One person feels unseen. The other feels like nothing they do is enough.

Don''t make it a competition over whose needs matter more. Say what you need, listen to what they need, and meet somewhere in the middle.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s a strong pull here, but you may not always feel like you''re coming from the same place. One person''s way of being can bring up a lot of feelings in the other person, sometimes in a good way, sometimes in a \"why am I reacting like this?\" way.\n\nAt its best, you balance each other out. One person brings direction, confidence, or clarity. The other brings care, sensitivity, and emotional reality. You may feel like this person has something you need, even when they also get on your nerves.\n\nThe problem is that it can turn into a standoff. One person feels unseen. The other feels like nothing they do is enough.\n\nDon''t make it a competition over whose needs matter more. Say what you need, listen to what they need, and meet somewhere in the middle."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The problem is that it can turn into a standoff. One person feels unseen. The other feels like nothing they do is enough."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Don''t make it a competition over whose needs matter more. Say what you need, listen to what they need, and meet somewhere in the middle."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-moon_opposition","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Opposite by nature, drawn together for it. One leads with identity, the other with feeling, and you complete and irritate each other in equal measure. Failure mode: keeping score, or swinging between fusion and friction. Trade roles on purpose, value the contrast, and stop tallying who gave more.","summaryDeep":"There''s a strong pull here, but you may not always feel like you''re coming from the same place. One person''s way of being can bring up a lot of feelings in the other person, sometimes in a good way, sometimes in a \"why am I reacting like this?\" way.\n\nAt its best, you balance each other out. One person brings direction, confidence, or clarity. The other brings care, sensitivity, and emotional reality. You may feel like this person has something you need, even when they also get on your nerves.\n\nThe problem is that it can turn into a standoff. One person feels unseen. The other feels like nothing they do is enough.\n\nDon''t make it a competition over whose needs matter more. Say what you need, listen to what they need, and meet somewhere in the middle.","tension":"The problem is that it can turn into a standoff. One person feels unseen. The other feels like nothing they do is enough.","advice":"Don''t make it a competition over whose needs matter more. Say what you need, listen to what they need, and meet somewhere in the middle.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-moon_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"moon","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-moon_sextile', 'synastry-sun-sextile-moon', 'relationship-sun-sextile-moon']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-moon_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-moon_sextile","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Sextile Moon', 'There''s a good fit here, but it gets better when both people actually put something into it. One person''s way of being can support the other person''s emotional needs, especially when there''s effort, attention, and basic follow-through.', 'There''s a good fit here, but it gets better when both people actually put something into it. One person''s way of being can support the other person''s emotional needs, especially when there''s effort, attention, and basic follow-through.

This is the kind of connection where small things count. Checking in. Remembering what matters. Being a little more present than you technically have to be. The more you invest, the safer and warmer it feels.

The problem is leaving it half-open. The compatibility is there, but it may stay kind of mild if both people wait for the other one to make it more real.

Make the effort. Not a grand gesture, just enough to show the connection matters.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s a good fit here, but it gets better when both people actually put something into it. One person''s way of being can support the other person''s emotional needs, especially when there''s effort, attention, and basic follow-through.\n\nThis is the kind of connection where small things count. Checking in. Remembering what matters. Being a little more present than you technically have to be. The more you invest, the safer and warmer it feels.\n\nThe problem is leaving it half-open. The compatibility is there, but it may stay kind of mild if both people wait for the other one to make it more real.\n\nMake the effort. Not a grand gesture, just enough to show the connection matters."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The problem is leaving it half-open. The compatibility is there, but it may stay kind of mild if both people wait for the other one to make it more real."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Make the effort. Not a grand gesture, just enough to show the connection matters."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-moon_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Identity and emotion fit comfortably, with room to grow the bond. You support each other''s nature without much effort, and there''s an opening to deepen. Failure mode: leaving it at nice and not investing. Take the opening - this is good raw material for a real partnership.","summaryDeep":"There''s a good fit here, but it gets better when both people actually put something into it. One person''s way of being can support the other person''s emotional needs, especially when there''s effort, attention, and basic follow-through.\n\nThis is the kind of connection where small things count. Checking in. Remembering what matters. Being a little more present than you technically have to be. The more you invest, the safer and warmer it feels.\n\nThe problem is leaving it half-open. The compatibility is there, but it may stay kind of mild if both people wait for the other one to make it more real.\n\nMake the effort. Not a grand gesture, just enough to show the connection matters.","tension":"The problem is leaving it half-open. The compatibility is there, but it may stay kind of mild if both people wait for the other one to make it more real.","advice":"Make the effort. Not a grand gesture, just enough to show the connection matters.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-moon_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"moon","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-moon_square', 'synastry-sun-square-moon', 'relationship-sun-square-moon']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-moon_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-moon_square","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Square Moon', 'There''s a connection here, but it can rub the wrong way. One person''s natural style may clash with what the other person needs to feel safe, cared for, or understood.', 'There''s a connection here, but it can rub the wrong way. One person''s natural style may clash with what the other person needs to feel safe, cared for, or understood.

It can show up in ordinary little moments. One person wants to move on, the other wants to talk it through. One person needs space, the other needs reassurance. Nobody has to be doing anything terrible for it to still feel frustrating.

The problem is taking the mismatch personally. You can start thinking, "Why are they like this?" when really, the two of you may just have different settings.

Don''t let every small rub become a larger story about the relationship. Name the pattern, adjust, and stop expecting the other person to magically know what would make you feel better.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s a connection here, but it can rub the wrong way. One person''s natural style may clash with what the other person needs to feel safe, cared for, or understood.\n\nIt can show up in ordinary little moments. One person wants to move on, the other wants to talk it through. One person needs space, the other needs reassurance. Nobody has to be doing anything terrible for it to still feel frustrating.\n\nThe problem is taking the mismatch personally. You can start thinking, \"Why are they like this?\" when really, the two of you may just have different settings.\n\nDon''t let every small rub become a larger story about the relationship. Name the pattern, adjust, and stop expecting the other person to magically know what would make you feel better."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The problem is taking the mismatch personally. You can start thinking, \"Why are they like this?\" when really, the two of you may just have different settings."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Don''t let every small rub become a larger story about the relationship. Name the pattern, adjust, and stop expecting the other person to magically know what would make you feel better."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-moon_square","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Core friction between identity and emotional need. What one wants to be grates on what the other needs to feel safe. Workable, not doom; many lasting couples carry it. Failure mode: reading the friction as proof you''re wrong for each other. Name the specific clash and keep negotiating - this aspect rewards patience.","summaryDeep":"There''s a connection here, but it can rub the wrong way. One person''s natural style may clash with what the other person needs to feel safe, cared for, or understood.\n\nIt can show up in ordinary little moments. One person wants to move on, the other wants to talk it through. One person needs space, the other needs reassurance. Nobody has to be doing anything terrible for it to still feel frustrating.\n\nThe problem is taking the mismatch personally. You can start thinking, \"Why are they like this?\" when really, the two of you may just have different settings.\n\nDon''t let every small rub become a larger story about the relationship. Name the pattern, adjust, and stop expecting the other person to magically know what would make you feel better.","tension":"The problem is taking the mismatch personally. You can start thinking, \"Why are they like this?\" when really, the two of you may just have different settings.","advice":"Don''t let every small rub become a larger story about the relationship. Name the pattern, adjust, and stop expecting the other person to magically know what would make you feel better.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-moon_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"moon","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-moon_trine', 'synastry-sun-trine-moon', 'relationship-sun-trine-moon']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-moon_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-moon_trine","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Trine Moon', 'This is an easy emotional fit. One person''s personality tends to work well with the other person''s needs, so the relationship can feel calm, familiar, and simple in a good way.', 'This is an easy emotional fit. One person''s personality tends to work well with the other person''s needs, so the relationship can feel calm, familiar, and simple in a good way.

You may not have to explain yourself as much with this person. Being together can feel like a break from the usual effort of being understood. There''s a softness here, but it doesn''t have to be sentimental.

The problem is that easy can become lazy. Because the connection feels natural, both people may assume it will just keep going without much care.

Don''t sleep on the good thing just because it isn''t causing problems. Keep showing up for it.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This is an easy emotional fit. One person''s personality tends to work well with the other person''s needs, so the relationship can feel calm, familiar, and simple in a good way.\n\nYou may not have to explain yourself as much with this person. Being together can feel like a break from the usual effort of being understood. There''s a softness here, but it doesn''t have to be sentimental.\n\nThe problem is that easy can become lazy. Because the connection feels natural, both people may assume it will just keep going without much care.\n\nDon''t sleep on the good thing just because it isn''t causing problems. Keep showing up for it."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The problem is that easy can become lazy. Because the connection feels natural, both people may assume it will just keep going without much care."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Don''t sleep on the good thing just because it isn''t causing problems. Keep showing up for it."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-moon_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A natural, easy fit between who one is and what the other needs. Drives and feelings sync; the relationship feels like home fast. Failure mode: comfort breeds passivity. Stay awake in it - easy compatibility still needs effort to become something.","summaryDeep":"This is an easy emotional fit. One person''s personality tends to work well with the other person''s needs, so the relationship can feel calm, familiar, and simple in a good way.\n\nYou may not have to explain yourself as much with this person. Being together can feel like a break from the usual effort of being understood. There''s a softness here, but it doesn''t have to be sentimental.\n\nThe problem is that easy can become lazy. Because the connection feels natural, both people may assume it will just keep going without much care.\n\nDon''t sleep on the good thing just because it isn''t causing problems. Keep showing up for it.","tension":"The problem is that easy can become lazy. Because the connection feels natural, both people may assume it will just keep going without much care.","advice":"Don''t sleep on the good thing just because it isn''t causing problems. Keep showing up for it.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-neptune_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"neptune","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-neptune_conjunction', 'synastry-sun-conjunction-neptune', 'relationship-sun-conjunction-neptune']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-neptune_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-neptune_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Conjunction Neptune', null, 'This person may see something in you before you see it in yourself.

The Neptune person often comes to the Sun person not with knowledge, but with trust. Not the trust that is based on evidence, but the trust of the heart. They look and see a flower where others see only a seed. Long before there is any proof, they feel what may become.

For the Sun person, this can be a strange and beautiful experience. It can feel as though someone has looked beyond the personality, beyond the masks and accumulated history, and recognized something essential. They may feel valued not for what they have accomplished, but for who they are at their core. In that recognition, parts of themselves that have long been dormant may begin to awaken.

At its best, this aspect can feel like a blessing. The Neptune person reflects back possibilities the Sun person may have forgotten, neglected, or never believed were theirs to begin with. Around them, the Sun person may feel more connected to their imagination, their compassion, their creativity, or their sense of purpose. There can be a feeling that something meaningful is moving through the relationship, something that cannot be measured but can be felt.

And yet Neptune''s gifts are rarely uncomplicated. The same vision that inspires can also distort. The Neptune person may be relating to a dream, a longing, or an ideal as much as they are relating to the actual person in front of them. The Sun person may find themselves stepping into that role, consciously or not, because it feels good to be adored for what someone believes you could be. But no one can live inside a projection forever. Eventually the human being beneath the image asks to be seen. When reality arrives, it can feel like a loss, not because the connection was false, but because the fantasy was so powerful.

The invitation here is to let wonder and truth exist together, without asking either one to disappear. This aspect works best when both people make room for reality from the beginning. Being admired is not the same as being truly seen.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person may see something in you before you see it in yourself.\n\nThe Neptune person often comes to the Sun person not with knowledge, but with trust. Not the trust that is based on evidence, but the trust of the heart. They look and see a flower where others see only a seed. Long before there is any proof, they feel what may become.\n\nFor the Sun person, this can be a strange and beautiful experience. It can feel as though someone has looked beyond the personality, beyond the masks and accumulated history, and recognized something essential. They may feel valued not for what they have accomplished, but for who they are at their core. In that recognition, parts of themselves that have long been dormant may begin to awaken.\n\nAt its best, this aspect can feel like a blessing. The Neptune person reflects back possibilities the Sun person may have forgotten, neglected, or never believed were theirs to begin with. Around them, the Sun person may feel more connected to their imagination, their compassion, their creativity, or their sense of purpose. There can be a feeling that something meaningful is moving through the relationship, something that cannot be measured but can be felt.\n\nAnd yet Neptune''s gifts are rarely uncomplicated. The same vision that inspires can also distort. The Neptune person may be relating to a dream, a longing, or an ideal as much as they are relating to the actual person in front of them. The Sun person may find themselves stepping into that role, consciously or not, because it feels good to be adored for what someone believes you could be. But no one can live inside a projection forever. Eventually the human being beneath the image asks to be seen. When reality arrives, it can feel like a loss, not because the connection was false, but because the fantasy was so powerful.\n\nThe invitation here is to let wonder and truth exist together, without asking either one to disappear. This aspect works best when both people make room for reality from the beginning. Being admired is not the same as being truly seen."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"And yet Neptune''s gifts are rarely uncomplicated. The same vision that inspires can also distort. The Neptune person may be relating to a dream, a longing, or an ideal as much as they are relating to the actual person in front of them. The Sun person may find themselves stepping into that role, consciously or not, because it feels good to be adored for what someone believes you could be. But no one can live inside a projection forever. Eventually the human being beneath the image asks to be seen. When reality arrives, it can feel like a loss, not because the connection was false, but because the fantasy was so powerful."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"The invitation here is to let wonder and truth exist together, without asking either one to disappear. This aspect works best when both people make room for reality from the beginning. Being admired is not the same as being truly seen."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-neptune_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s identity meets B''s dreams. The conjunction fuses them - intense and inseparable.","summaryDeep":"This person may see something in you before you see it in yourself.\n\nThe Neptune person often comes to the Sun person not with knowledge, but with trust. Not the trust that is based on evidence, but the trust of the heart. They look and see a flower where others see only a seed. Long before there is any proof, they feel what may become.\n\nFor the Sun person, this can be a strange and beautiful experience. It can feel as though someone has looked beyond the personality, beyond the masks and accumulated history