e this aspect can deliver on its promise.","tension":"Even in a harmonious aspect like this, Neptune can make things a little blurry around the edges. Because being together feels so natural, it''s easy to gloss over the small moments when you''re not seeing each other quite clearly. The Sun person may enjoy being admired and believed in. The Neptune person may prefer the version of the relationship that feels beautiful rather than asking harder questions about what''s actually there. Nothing dramatic has to happen for this to become a problem. Sometimes it''s just a tendency to let things slide, to avoid uncomfortable conversations, or to assume everything is fine because the connection feels good. Over time, those unspoken realities can quietly build up in the background.","advice":"The key is to enjoy the magic without losing touch with what''s real. Let the relationship inspire you, but stay honest about who you are and who the other person is. The more clearly you see each other, the more this aspect can deliver on its promise.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":5}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-pluto_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"pluto","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-pluto_conjunction', 'synastry-sun-conjunction-pluto', 'relationship-sun-conjunction-pluto']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-pluto_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-pluto_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Conjunction Pluto', null, 'This person can feel like an obsession before you have words for why.

The charge is immediate. Electric. Unsettling. It can feel as though the Pluto person recognizes something in you that even you have not fully claimed. You may feel exposed, chosen, pulled into a current so powerful that ordinary attraction suddenly feels insignificant.

There is a raw magnetism here that is difficult to resist. The Pluto person often awakens something dormant in the Sun person. Buried desires, hidden strengths, long-forgotten hungers, and truths that have been waiting beneath the surface. Their fascination can feel intoxicating. Their presence can make the Sun person feel more alive, more visible, more powerful than they have in a very long time.

But Pluto does not touch anything lightly. The conjunction amplifies everything. Desire becomes consuming. Curiosity becomes fixation. Intimacy becomes a force that can alter the landscape of both people''s lives. What feels like deep recognition can slowly become entanglement. What feels like devotion can become possession. The main challenge is that strong emotions can sometimes be mistaken for genuine understanding or connection. The Pluto person may have a clear sense of the Sun person''s vulnerabilities, desires, and emotional needs, which can create a powerful bond. If this dynamic is handled poorly, however, it can become overwhelming. The Sun person may find it difficult to maintain perspective or create healthy distance when needed.

This aspect can be deeply transformative, but it''s important to stay connected to your own center as it unfolds. Keep your boundaries clear and trust your own perspective, even when the connection feels powerful. Let the relationship teach you what it has to teach, but remember that growth doesn''t require giving away your agency.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person can feel like an obsession before you have words for why.\n\nThe charge is immediate. Electric. Unsettling. It can feel as though the Pluto person recognizes something in you that even you have not fully claimed. You may feel exposed, chosen, pulled into a current so powerful that ordinary attraction suddenly feels insignificant.\n\nThere is a raw magnetism here that is difficult to resist. The Pluto person often awakens something dormant in the Sun person. Buried desires, hidden strengths, long-forgotten hungers, and truths that have been waiting beneath the surface. Their fascination can feel intoxicating. Their presence can make the Sun person feel more alive, more visible, more powerful than they have in a very long time.\n\nBut Pluto does not touch anything lightly. The conjunction amplifies everything. Desire becomes consuming. Curiosity becomes fixation. Intimacy becomes a force that can alter the landscape of both people''s lives. What feels like deep recognition can slowly become entanglement. What feels like devotion can become possession. The main challenge is that strong emotions can sometimes be mistaken for genuine understanding or connection. The Pluto person may have a clear sense of the Sun person''s vulnerabilities, desires, and emotional needs, which can create a powerful bond. If this dynamic is handled poorly, however, it can become overwhelming. The Sun person may find it difficult to maintain perspective or create healthy distance when needed.\n\nThis aspect can be deeply transformative, but it''s important to stay connected to your own center as it unfol