  ('A-sun_B-pluto_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"pluto","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-pluto_opposition', 'synastry-sun-opposition-pluto', 'relationship-sun-opposition-pluto']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-pluto_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-pluto_opposition","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Opposition Pluto', null, 'This person may arrive as a mirror you didn''t ask for but cannot look away from. There is a powerful pull here, but it rarely comes without tension. The Pluto person often reflects back what the Sun person has not yet fully claimed, acknowledged, or understood about themselves. The attraction can feel undeniable, carrying the weight of recognition, as though something ancient has been awakened. At the same time, it can feel deeply uncomfortable. Being seen this clearly is not always easy.

At its best, this aspect invites self-awareness. The Pluto person challenges the Sun person to move beyond old identities, inherited stories, and carefully maintained appearances. Through the friction of difference, both people are asked to grow. The relationship can become a catalyst for honesty, helping each person encounter truths that might otherwise remain hidden.

But Pluto''s gifts are rarely offered without shadow work. This connection can activate questions of power, trust, and vulnerability. The Pluto person may instinctively sense where the Sun person feels most exposed, carrying an uncanny awareness of their fears, desires, and unspoken wounds. When that insight is used with care, it can deepen intimacy and understanding. When it is not, the dynamic can become imbalanced. One person may feel picked apart while the other gains the upper hand. The attraction can be intense, but so can the discomfort. This is the kind of bond that can become obsessive, controlling, and difficult to walk away from.

The key here is mutual respect. Without it, strong feelings can turn into control, and honesty can be used to hurt instead of help. This aspect asks both people to take responsibility for their own actions while being mindful of each other''s vulnerability.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person may arrive as a mirror you didn''t ask for but cannot look away from. There is a powerful pull here, but it rarely comes without tension. The Pluto person often reflects back what the Sun person has not yet fully claimed, acknowledged, or understood about themselves. The attraction can feel undeniable, carrying the weight of recognition, as though something ancient has been awakened. At the same time, it can feel deeply uncomfortable. Being seen this clearly is not always easy.\n\nAt its best, this aspect invites self-awareness. The Pluto person challenges the Sun person to move beyond old identities, inherited stories, and carefully maintained appearances. Through the friction of difference, both people are asked to grow. The relationship can become a catalyst for honesty, helping each person encounter truths that might otherwise remain hidden.\n\nBut Pluto''s gifts are rarely offered without shadow work. This connection can activate questions of power, trust, and vulnerability. The Pluto person may instinctively sense where the Sun person feels most exposed, carrying an uncanny awareness of their fears, desires, and unspoken wounds. When that insight is used with care, it can deepen intimacy and understanding. When it is not, the dynamic can become imbalanced. One person may feel picked apart while the other gains the upper hand. The attraction can be intense, but so can the discomfort. This is the kind of bond that can become obsessive, controlling, and difficult to walk away from.\n\nThe key here is mutual respect. Without it, strong feelings can turn into control, and honesty can be used to hurt instead of help. This aspect asks both people to tak