  ('A-sun_B-pluto_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"pluto","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-pluto_sextile', 'synastry-sun-sextile-pluto', 'relationship-sun-sextile-pluto']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-pluto_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-pluto_sextile","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Sextile Pluto', null, 'This connection carries a quiet kind of magic. Nothing is demanded of you here. Nothing is ripped open before you''re ready. Instead, the Pluto person may recognize gifts, truths, and untapped power within the Sun person long before those qualities have fully emerged. There is depth in this bond, but it moves gently, like an invitation rather than a command.

When nurtured consciously, this aspect can become a beautiful catalyst for growth. The Pluto person may inspire the Sun person to trust their inner authority, pursue what feels deeply meaningful, and step more fully into their own power. In return, the Sun person''s vitality, creativity, and sense of purpose can help the Pluto person direct their intensity toward healing, creation, and transformation.

The beauty of this aspect is that it honors free will. Growth is available, but it is never forced. The doorway is open, yet each person must choose whether to walk through it. The more willing both people are to meet themselves honestly, the more wisdom and empowerment this connection can reveal.

The shadow here is not overwhelm but inertia. Because the energy flows so naturally, it can be easy to enjoy the connection without exploring its deeper potential. The relationship may remain supportive and meaningful while deeper layers of healing, self-discovery, and transformation quietly wait to be claimed.

Stay curious about what this person awakens within you. Notice the parts of yourself that become more visible in their presence. Pay attention to the truths that rise gently to the surface. Let the connection deepen your relationship with yourself while remaining rooted in your own center. Transformation does not always arrive through crisis or upheaval. Sometimes it unfolds through trust.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This connection carries a quiet kind of magic. Nothing is demanded of you here. Nothing is ripped open before you''re ready. Instead, the Pluto person may recognize gifts, truths, and untapped power within the Sun person long before those qualities have fully emerged. There is depth in this bond, but it moves gently, like an invitation rather than a command.\n\nWhen nurtured consciously, this aspect can become a beautiful catalyst for growth. The Pluto person may inspire the Sun person to trust their inner authority, pursue what feels deeply meaningful, and step more fully into their own power. In return, the Sun person''s vitality, creativity, and sense of purpose can help the Pluto person direct their intensity toward healing, creation, and transformation.\n\nThe beauty of this aspect is that it honors free will. Growth is available, but it is never forced. The doorway is open, yet each person must choose whether to walk through it. The more willing both people are to meet themselves honestly, the more wisdom and empowerment this connection can reveal.\n\nThe shadow here is not overwhelm but inertia. Because the energy flows so naturally, it can be easy to enjoy the connection without exploring its deeper potential. The relationship may remain supportive and meaningful while deeper layers of healing, self-discovery, and transformation quietly wait to be claimed.\n\nStay curious about what this person awakens within you. Notice the parts of yourself that become more visible in their presence. Pay attention to the truths that rise gently to the surface. Let the connection deepen your relationship with yourself while remaining rooted in your own center. Transformation does not always arrive through crisis or upheaval. Sometimes it unfolds through trust."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The shadow here is not overwhelm but inertia. Because the energy flows so naturally, it can be easy to enjoy the connection without exploring its deeper potential. The relationship may remain supportive and meaningful while deeper layers of healing, self-discovery, and transformation quietly wait to be claimed."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Stay curious about what this person awakens within you. Notice the parts of yourself that become more visible in their presence. Pay attention to the truths that rise gently to the surface. Let the connection deepen your relationship with yourself while remaining rooted in your own center. Transformation does not always arrive through crisis or upheaval. Sometimes it unfolds through trust."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-pluto_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s identity meets B''s depth and power. The sextile supports them, if you act on it.","summaryDeep":"This connection carries a quiet kind of magic. Nothing is demanded of you here. Nothing is ripped open before you''re ready. Instead, the Pluto person may recognize gifts, truths, and untapped power within the Sun person long before those qualities have fully emerged. There is depth in this bond, but it moves gently, like an invitation rather than a command.\n\nWhen nurtured consciously, this aspect can become a beautiful catalyst for growth. The Pluto person may inspire the Sun person to trust their inner authority, pursue what feels deeply meaningful, and step more fully into their own power. In return, the Sun person''s vitality, creativity, and sense of purpose can help the Pluto person direct their intensity toward healing, creation, and transformation.\n\nThe beauty of this aspect is that it honors free will. Growth is available, but it is never forced. The doorway is open, yet each person must choose whether to walk through it. The more willing both people are to meet themselves honestly, the more wisdom and empowerment this connection can reveal.\n\nThe shadow here is not overwhelm but inertia. Because the energy flows so naturally, it can be easy to enjoy the connection without exploring its deeper potential. The relationship may remain supportive and meaningful while deeper layers of healing, self-discovery, and transformation quietly wait to be claimed.\n\nStay curious about what this person awakens within you. Notice the parts of yourself that become more visible in their presence. Pay attention to the truths that rise gently to the surface. Let the connection deepen your relationship with yourself while remaining rooted in your own center. Transformation does not always arrive through crisis or upheaval. Sometimes it unfolds through trust.","tension":"The shadow here is not overwhelm but inertia. Because the energy flows so naturally, it can be easy to enjoy the connection without exploring its deeper potential. The relationship may remain supportive and meaningful while deeper layers of healing, self-discovery, and transformation quietly wait to be claimed.","advice":"Stay curious about what this person awakens within you. Notice the parts of yourself that become more visible in their presence. Pay attention to the truths that rise gently to the surface. Let the connection deepen your relationship with yourself while remaining rooted in your own center. Transformation does not always arrive through crisis or upheaval. Sometimes it unfolds through trust.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":5}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_