  ('A-sun_B-uranus_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"uranus","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-uranus_trine', 'synastry-sun-trine-uranus', 'relationship-sun-trine-uranus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-uranus_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-uranus_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Trine Uranus', null, 'A''s identity meets B''s need for freedom. The trine lets them flow together easily.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Translation","body":"A''s identity meets B''s need for freedom. The trine lets them flow together easily."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-uranus_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s identity meets B''s need for freedom. The trine lets them flow together easily.","summaryDeep":null,"tension":null,"advice":null,"policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Imported from project-authored synastry matrix material. Source file was not copied into the repository.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":null,"weight":null}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-venus_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"venus","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-venus_conjunction', 'synastry-sun-conjunction-venus', 'relationship-sun-conjunction-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-venus_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-venus_conjunction","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Conjunction Venus', 'There''s an easy fondness here. One person''s way of being just feels likable to the other, almost without trying. You may enjoy each other''s company right away, and there can be a real sense of being appreciated for who you already are.', 'There''s an easy fondness here. One person''s way of being just feels likable to the other, almost without trying. You may enjoy each other''s company right away, and there can be a real sense of being appreciated for who you already are.

This tends to feel good without needing much explanation. Compliments come more naturally. Affection is easier to show. Being together may feel pleasant, warm, and simple in a way that makes both people want to come back for more. It''s the kind of connection where you actually like the person, not just want their attention.

The thing to watch is that pleasant can stay shallow. If everything stays nice and nobody ever pushes past the easy surface, the connection can stall at "we get along great" without becoming much deeper.

Let yourself enjoy it, but don''t stop at nice. Liking someone is a good start, not the whole story.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s an easy fondness here. One person''s way of being just feels likable to the other, almost without trying. You may enjoy each other''s company right away, and there can be a real sense of being appreciated for who you already are.\n\nThis tends to feel good without needing much explanation. Compliments come more naturally. Affection is easier to show. Being together may feel pleasant, warm, and simple in a way that makes both people want to come back for more. It''s the kind of connection where you actually like the person, not just want their attention.\n\nThe thing to watch is that pleasant can stay shallow. If everything stays nice and nobody ever pushes past the easy surface, the connection can stall at \"we get along great\" without becoming much deeper.\n\nLet yourself enjoy it, but don''t stop at nice. Liking someone is a good start, not the whole story."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The thing to watch is that pleasant can stay shallow. If everything stays nice and nobody ever pushes past the easy surface, the connection can stall at \"we get along great\" without becoming much deeper."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Let yourself enjoy it, but don''t stop at nice. Liking someone is a good start, not the whole story."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-venus_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Warm, affectionate, naturally drawn together. The Venus person adores the Sun person; the Sun person feels appreciated and seen. One of the gentlest attraction contacts. Failure mode: pleasant but passive - lots of warmth, little drive. Enjoy the affection, and make sure something supplies the momentum.","summaryDeep":"There''s an easy fondness here. One person''s way of being just feels likable to the other, almost without trying. You may enjoy each other''s company right away, and there can be a real sense of being appreciated for who you already are.\n\nThis tends to feel good without needing much explanation. Compliments come more naturally. Affection is easier to show. Being together may feel pleasant, warm, and simple in a way that makes both people want to come back for more. It''s the kind of connection where you actually like the person, not just want their attention.\n\nThe thing to watch is that pleasant can stay shallow. If everything stays nice and nobody ever pushes past the easy surface, the connection can stall at \"we get along great\" without becoming much deeper.\n\nLet yourself enjoy it, but don''t stop at nice. Liking someone is a good start, not the whole story.","tension":"The thing to watch is that pleasant can stay shallow. If everything stays nice and nobody ever pushes past the easy surface, the connection can stall at \"we get along great\" without becoming much deeper.","advice":"Let yourself enjoy it, but don''t stop at nice. Liking someone is a good start, not the whole story.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-venus_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"venus","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-venus_opposition', 'synastry-sun-opposition-venus', 'relationship-sun-opposition-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-venus_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-venus_opposition","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Opposition Venus', 'There''s attraction here, but you may not always like or value things in the same way. One person can find the other charming partly because they''re different, but that same difference can also make the connection feel a little uneven.', 'There''s attraction here, but you may not always like or value things in the same way. One person can find the other charming partly because they''re different, but that same difference can also make the connection feel a little uneven.

At its best, this is the pull of someone who brings a different style, mood, or way of showing affection. They may make life feel more interesting, more beautiful, or just less like your usual routine. At its worst, you keep running into the gap between what one person means as love and what the other person actually receives.

The problem is expecting appreciation to look the same on both sides. The attraction may be real, but you may not always agree on what feels thoughtful, romantic, or worth caring about.

Appreciate the difference without making it a test. Find what you both enjoy, instead of trying to win the argument about taste.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s attraction here, but you may not always like or value things in the same way. One person can find the other charming partly because they''re different, but that same difference can also make the connection feel a little uneven.\n\nAt its best, this is the pull of someone who brings a different style, mood, or way of showing affection. They may make life feel more interesting, more beautiful, or just less like your usual routine. At its worst, you keep running into the gap between what one person means as love and what the other person actually receives.\n\nThe problem is expecting appreciation to look the same on both sides. The attraction may be real, but you may not always agree on what feels thoughtful, romantic, or worth caring about.\n\nAppreciate the difference without making it a test. Find what you both enjoy, instead of trying to win the argument about taste."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The problem is expecting appreciation to look the same on both sides. The attraction may be real, but you may not always agree on what feels thoughtful, romantic, or worth caring about."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Appreciate the difference without making it a test. Find what you both enjoy, instead of trying to win the argument about taste."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-venus_opposition","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Mutual attraction across a difference in style or taste. You''re drawn together but value different things. Failure mode: low-grade friction over aesthetics or priorities. Let the contrast add color instead of arguing over it.","summaryDeep":"There''s attraction here, but you may not always like or value things in the same way. One person can find the other charming partly because they''re different, but that same difference can also make the connection feel a little uneven.\n\nAt its best, this is the pull of someone who brings a different style, mood, or way of showing affection. They may make life feel more interesting, more beautiful, or just less like your usual routine. At its worst, you keep running into the gap between what one person means as love and what the other person actually receives.\n\nThe problem is expecting appreciation to look the same on both sides. The attraction may be real, but you may not always agree on what feels thoughtful, romantic, or worth caring about.\n\nAppreciate the difference without making it a test. Find what you both enjoy, instead of trying to win the argument about taste.","tension":"The problem is expecting appreciation to look the same on both sides. The attraction may be real, but you may not always agree on what feels thoughtful, romantic, or worth caring about.","advice":"Appreciate the difference without making it a test. Find what you both enjoy, instead of trying to win the argument about taste.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-venus_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"venus","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-venus_sextile', 'synastry-sun-sextile-venus', 'relationship-sun-sextile-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-venus_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-venus_sextile","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Sextile Venus', 'There''s a warm, likable fit here, and it gets better when both people put something into it. One person''s way of being and the other person''s affection support each other well, but the warmth tends to open more when you actually lean into it.', 'There''s a warm, likable fit here, and it gets better when both people put something into it. One person''s way of being and the other person''s affection support each other well, but the warmth tends to open more when you actually lean into it.

This often shows up as a connection that gets nicer the more you engage. A little appreciation goes a long way. Small kindnesses are noticed. The fondness is available, but it becomes stronger when someone bothers to show it.

Where it falls flat is leaving the good feeling unspoken. Both people may assume the other knows they''re appreciated, and then the connection stays quieter than it needs to be.

Say the nice thing out loud. This one grows every time someone bothers to express it.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s a warm, likable fit here, and it gets better when both people put something into it. One person''s way of being and the other person''s affection support each other well, but the warmth tends to open more when you actually lean into it.\n\nThis often shows up as a connection that gets nicer the more you engage. A little appreciation goes a long way. Small kindnesses are noticed. The fondness is available, but it becomes stronger when someone bothers to show it.\n\nWhere it falls flat is leaving the good feeling unspoken. Both people may assume the other knows they''re appreciated, and then the connection stays quieter than it needs to be.\n\nSay the nice thing out loud. This one grows every time someone bothers to express it."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"Where it falls flat is leaving the good feeling unspoken. Both people may assume the other knows they''re appreciated, and then the connection stays quieter than it needs to be."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Say the nice thing out loud. This one grows every time someone bothers to express it."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-venus_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Easy warmth and mutual appreciation, with room to act on it. You like each other and it shows. Failure mode: coasting on the niceness. Take the opening and let it grow.","summaryDeep":"There''s a warm, likable fit here, and it gets better when both people put something into it. One person''s way of being and the other person''s affection support each other well, but the warmth tends to open more when you actually lean into it.\n\nThis often shows up as a connection that gets nicer the more you engage. A little appreciation goes a long way. Small kindnesses are noticed. The fondness is available, but it becomes stronger when someone bothers to show it.\n\nWhere it falls flat is leaving the good feeling unspoken. Both people may assume the other knows they''re appreciated, and then the connection stays quieter than it needs to be.\n\nSay the nice thing out loud. This one grows every time someone bothers to express it.","tension":"Where it falls flat is leaving the good feeling unspoken. Both people may assume the other knows they''re appreciated, and then the connection stays quieter than it needs to be.","advice":"Say the nice thing out loud. This one grows every time someone bothers to express it.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-venus_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"venus","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-venus_square', 'synastry-sun-square-venus', 'relationship-sun-square-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-venus_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-venus_square","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Square Venus', 'There''s attraction here, but it can come with a little friction around affection, taste, or feeling appreciated. One person''s natural style may not quite match how the other person likes to give or receive warmth, so the fondness is real but slightly out of step.', 'There''s attraction here, but it can come with a little friction around affection, taste, or feeling appreciated. One person''s natural style may not quite match how the other person likes to give or receive warmth, so the fondness is real but slightly out of step.

It often shows up in small ways. One person shows they care in a way the other doesn''t fully register. Compliments land oddly. Gestures get misread. Nobody''s being cold; the affection just keeps arriving in the wrong key.

The trap is reading the mismatch as a lack of caring. The feeling may be there, but the delivery keeps getting crossed.

Say what actually makes you feel appreciated instead of waiting to receive it the way you''d give it. This one smooths out when both people stop expecting love to arrive in their exact language.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s attraction here, but it can come with a little friction around affection, taste, or feeling appreciated. One person''s natural style may not quite match how the other person likes to give or receive warmth, so the fondness is real but slightly out of step.\n\nIt often shows up in small ways. One person shows they care in a way the other doesn''t fully register. Compliments land oddly. Gestures get misread. Nobody''s being cold; the affection just keeps arriving in the wrong key.\n\nThe trap is reading the mismatch as a lack of caring. The feeling may be there, but the delivery keeps getting crossed.\n\nSay what actually makes you feel appreciated instead of waiting to receive it the way you''d give it. This one smooths out when both people stop expecting love to arrive in their exact language."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The trap is reading the mismatch as a lack of caring. The feeling may be there, but the delivery keeps getting crossed."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Say what actually makes you feel appreciated instead of waiting to receive it the way you''d give it. This one smooths out when both people stop expecting love to arrive in their exact language."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-venus_square","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Affection slightly off-key. The Venus person''s way of loving doesn''t quite match what the Sun person wants to be appreciated for. Failure mode: small, persistent feelings of being unseen. Adjust how you show appreciation - a tuning problem, not a dealbreaker.","summaryDeep":"There''s attraction here, but it can come with a little friction around affection, taste, or feeling appreciated. One person''s natural style may not quite match how the other person likes to give or receive warmth, so the fondness is real but slightly out of step.\n\nIt often shows up in small ways. One person shows they care in a way the other doesn''t fully register. Compliments land oddly. Gestures get misread. Nobody''s being cold; the affection just keeps arriving in the wrong key.\n\nThe trap is reading the mismatch as a lack of caring. The feeling may be there, but the delivery keeps getting crossed.\n\nSay what actually makes you feel appreciated instead of waiting to receive it the way you''d give it. This one smooths out when both people stop expecting love to arrive in their exact language.","tension":"The trap is reading the mismatch as a lack of caring. The feeling may be there, but the delivery keeps getting crossed.","advice":"Say what actually makes you feel appreciated instead of waiting to receive it the way you''d give it. This one smooths out when both people stop expecting love to arrive in their exact language.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-sun_B-venus_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"sun","planetB":"venus","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-sun_B-venus_trine', 'synastry-sun-trine-venus', 'relationship-sun-trine-venus']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-sun_B-venus_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-sun_B-venus_trine","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Sun Trine Venus', 'This is a naturally warm, easy kind of connection. One person''s way of being sits well with the other person''s sense of what is lovable, so affection tends to flow without much effort.', 'This is a naturally warm, easy kind of connection. One person''s way of being sits well with the other person''s sense of what is lovable, so affection tends to flow without much effort.

There''s an unforced charm here. You enjoy each other, you appreciate each other, and there usually isn''t much drama around feeling valued. It''s the kind of ease that makes a relationship comfortable to be in and easy to stay close to.

The risk is the usual one with easy contacts: because the warmth comes naturally, neither person may think to deepen it or take care of it. A connection this pleasant can drift on autopilot.

Enjoy the ease, but keep offering something real. Pleasant is a gift, not a substitute for effort.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This is a naturally warm, easy kind of connection. One person''s way of being sits well with the other person''s sense of what is lovable, so affection tends to flow without much effort.\n\nThere''s an unforced charm here. You enjoy each other, you appreciate each other, and there usually isn''t much drama around feeling valued. It''s the kind of ease that makes a relationship comfortable to be in and easy to stay close to.\n\nThe risk is the usual one with easy contacts: because the warmth comes naturally, neither person may think to deepen it or take care of it. A connection this pleasant can drift on autopilot.\n\nEnjoy the ease, but keep offering something real. Pleasant is a gift, not a substitute for effort."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The risk is the usual one with easy contacts: because the warmth comes naturally, neither person may think to deepen it or take care of it. A connection this pleasant can drift on autopilot."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Enjoy the ease, but keep offering something real. Pleasant is a gift, not a substitute for effort."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-sun_B-venus_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Affection that flows effortlessly. The Sun person feels valued, the Venus person feels at ease - smooth, harmonious, kind. Failure mode: lacking tension or challenge. A warm foundation; keep it from getting sleepy.","summaryDeep":"This is a naturally warm, easy kind of connection. One person''s way of being sits well with the other person''s sense of what is lovable, so affection tends to flow without much effort.\n\nThere''s an unforced charm here. You enjoy each other, you appreciate each other, and there usually isn''t much drama around feeling valued. It''s the kind of ease that makes a relationship comfortable to be in and easy to stay close to.\n\nThe risk is the usual one with easy contacts: because the warmth comes naturally, neither person may think to deepen it or take care of it. A connection this pleasant can drift on autopilot.\n\nEnjoy the ease, but keep offering something real. Pleasant is a gift, not a substitute for effort.","tension":"The risk is the usual one with easy contacts: because the warmth comes naturally, neither person may think to deepen it or take care of it. A connection this pleasant can drift on autopilot.","advice":"Enjoy the ease, but keep offering something real. Pleasant is a gift, not a substitute for effort.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
