at says you were thinking of them, the plan you actually make, saying the nice thing out loud instead of figuring they know. Small stuff, and it adds up fast.\n\nThat''s the catch with this one. The warmth opens the door and then just stands there. Coast on it, assume it runs itself, and you end up with a great connection you never actually used.\n\nSo treat it like anything good. Show up for it. The more you put in, the more this person becomes someone you can count on, instead of a nice thing you let slip.","tension":"That''s the catch with this one. The warmth opens the door and then just stands there. Coast on it, assume it runs itself, and you end up with a great connection you never actually used.","advice":"So treat it like anything good. Show up for it. The more you put in, the more this person becomes someone you can count on, instead of a nice thing you let slip.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-jupiter_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"jupiter","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-jupiter_square', 'synastry-venus-square-jupiter', 'relationship-venus-square-jupiter']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-jupiter_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-jupiter_square","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Square Jupiter', null, 'This person may awaken in you a larger appetite for life. In their presence, pleasure expands. You may feel drawn to celebrate more, give more, forgive more, and say yes to experiences you would normally hold at a distance. There is a temptation to get carried away by what feels good in the moment. This can be a blessing, because it encourages openness, generosity, and joy. But it can also become a kind of unconsciousness when enjoyment begins to run ahead of awareness.

When this works, they help you soften. They may remind you that joy matters, that generosity matters, that life does not have to be all restraint and responsibility. Their presence can pull you out of scarcity and into a more open relationship with pleasure.

The challenge is excess. Too much spending. Too much saying yes because the moment feels good. Too much relying on good feelings to carry the relationship instead of addressing what needs attention. This is where the connection needs honesty. Pleasure is not the problem. Avoidance is. Generosity is not the problem. Lack of limits is.

Let this person broaden your perspective without losing sight of your priorities. This connection works best when both people appreciate the opportunities in front of them while staying realistic.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This person may awaken in you a larger appetite for life. In their presence, pleasure expands. You may feel drawn to celebrate more, give more, forgive more, and say yes to experiences you would normally hold at a distance. There is a temptation to get carried away by what feels good in the moment. This can be a blessing, because it encourages openness, generosity, and joy. But it can also become a kind of unconsciousness when enjoyment begins to run ahead of awareness.\n\nWhen this works, they help you soften. They may remind you that joy matters, that generosity matters, that life does not have to be all restraint and responsibility. Their presence can pull you out of scarcity and into a more open relationship with pleasure.\n\nThe challenge is excess. Too much spending. Too much saying yes because the moment feels good. Too much relying on good feelings to carry the relationship instead of addressing what needs attention. This is where the connection needs honesty. Pleasure is not the problem. Avoidance is. Generosity is not the problem. Lack of limits is.\n\nLet this person broaden your perspective without losing sight of your priorities. This connection works best when both people appreciate the opportunities in front of them while staying realistic."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is excess. Too much spending. Too much saying yes because the moment feels good. Too much relying on good feelings to carry the relationship instead of addressing what needs attention. This is where the connection needs honesty. Pleasure is not the problem. Avoidance is. Generosity is not the problem. Lack of limits is."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Let this person broaden your perspective without losing sight of your priorities. This connection works best when both people appreciate the opportunities in front of them while staying realistic."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-jupiter_square","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s love and values meets B''s growth. The square puts them in friction.","summaryDeep":"This person may awaken in you a larger appetite for life. In their presence, pleasure expands. You may feel drawn to celebrate more, give more, forgive more, and say yes to experiences you would normally hold at a distance. There is a temptation to get carried away by what feels good in the moment. This can be a blessing, because it encourages openness, generosity, and joy. But it can also become a kind of unconsciousness when enjoyment begins to run ahead of awareness.\n\nWhen this works, they help you soften. They may remind you that joy matters, that generosity matters, that life does not have to be all restraint and responsibility. Their presence can pull you out of scarcity and into a more open relationship with pleasure.\n\nThe challenge is excess. Too much spending. Too much saying yes because the moment feels good. Too much relying on good feelings to carry the relationship instead of addressing what needs attention. This is where the connection needs honesty. Pleasure is not the problem. Avoidance is. Generosity is not the problem. Lack of limits is.\n\nLet this person broaden your perspective without losing sight of your priorities. This connection works best when both people appreciate the opportunities in front of them while staying realistic.","tension":"The challenge is excess. Too much spending. Too much saying yes because the moment feels good. Too much relying on good feelings to carry the relationship instead of addressing what needs attention. This is where the connection needs honesty. Pleasure is not the problem. Avoidance is. Generosity is not the problem. Lack of limits is.","advice":"Let this person broaden your perspective without losing sight of your priorities. This connection works best when both people appreciate the opportunities in front of them while staying realistic.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-jupiter_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"jupiter","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-jupiter_trine', 'synastry-venus-trine-jupiter', 'relationship-venus-trine-jupiter']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-jupiter_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-jupiter_trine","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Trine Jupiter', null, 'This relationship has a way of bringing out the best in both of you. You tend to give each other the benefit of the doubt, let small mistakes go, and pay more attention to what is working than what is not. Being together usually feels good. You enjoy each other, and life can seem a little easier in each other''s company.

When this works, the relationship creates a sense of momentum. You encourage each other to take up space, pursue what matters, and enjoy the good things life has to offer. Time together can leave both of you feeling more optimistic than before, as though the relationship reminds you of your strengths rather than your limitations. There is a natural generosity in the way you relate, making it easier to feel supported, appreciated, and genuinely happy for each other''s growth.

One of the best things about this connection is that it helps you appreciate what is working. It encourages both of you to enjoy the relationship instead of focusing only on responsibilities or problems. Time together can feel genuinely enjoyable, creating moments of happiness and connection that bring you closer.

A relationship can feel good and still need attention, effort, and honest conversation to keep moving forward.

Enjoy the vibe and everything that flows easily between you, but don''t just coast on it. Keep showing up, keep putting something into it. The connections that last are the ones people choose again and again, not just the ones that start out easy.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This relationship has a way of bringing out the best in both of you. You tend to give each other the benefit of the doubt, let small mistakes go, and pay more attention to what is working than what is not. Being together usually feels good. You enjoy each other, and life can seem a little easier in each other''s company.\n\nWhen this works, the relationship creates a sense of momentum. You encourage each other to take up space, pursue what matters, and enjoy the good things life has to offer. Time together can leave both of you feeling more optimistic than before, as though the relationship reminds you of your strengths rather than your limitations. There is a natural generosity in the way you relate, making it easier to feel supported, appreciated, and genuinely happy for each other''s growth.\n\nOne of the best things about this connection is that it helps you appreciate what is working. It encourages both of you to enjoy the relationship instead of focusing only on responsibilities or problems. Time together can feel genuinely enjoyable, creating moments of happiness and connection that bring you closer.\n\nA relationship can feel good and still need attention, effort, and honest conversation to keep moving forward.\n\nEnjoy the vibe and everything that flows easily between you, but don''t just coast on it. Keep showing up, keep putting something into it. The connections that last are the ones people choose again and again, not just the ones that start out easy."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"A relationship can feel good and still need attention, effort, and honest conversation to keep moving forward."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Enjoy the vibe and everything that flows easily between you, but don''t just coast on it. Keep showing up, keep putting something into it. The connections that last are the ones people choose again and again, not just the ones that start out easy."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-jupiter_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s love and values meets B''s growth. The trine lets them flow together easily.","summaryDeep":"This relationship has a way of bringing out the best in both of you. You tend to give each other the benefit of the doubt, let small mistakes go, and pay more attention to what is working than what is not. Being together usually feels good. You enjoy each other, and life can seem a little easier in each other''s company.\n\nWhen this works, the relationship creates a sense of momentum. You encourage each other to take up space, pursue what matters, and enjoy the good things life has to offer. Time together can leave both of you feeling more optimistic than before, as though the relationship reminds you of your strengths rather than your limitations. There is a natural generosity in the way you relate, making it easier to feel supported, appreciated, and genuinely happy for each other''s growth.\n\nOne of the best things about this connection is that it helps you appreciate what is working. It encourages both of you to enjoy the relationship instead of focusing only on responsibilities or problems. Time together can feel genuinely enjoyable, creating moments of happiness and connection that bring you closer.\n\nA relationship can feel good and still need attention, effort, and honest conversation to keep moving forward.\n\nEnjoy the vibe and everything that flows easily between you, but don''t just coast on it. Keep showing up, keep putting something into it. The connections that last are the ones people choose again and again, not just the ones that start out easy.","tension":"A relationship can feel good and still need attention, effort, and honest conversation to keep moving forward.","advice":"Enjoy the vibe and everything that flows easily between you, but don''t just coast on it. Keep showing up, keep putting something into it. The connections that last are the ones people choose again and again, not just the ones that start out easy.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":4}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-mars_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"mars","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-mars_conjunction', 'synastry-venus-conjunction-mars', 'relationship-venus-conjunction-mars']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-mars_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-mars_conjunction","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Conjunction Mars', 'The attraction is immediate. Venus and Mars are in the same place, so there isn''t much distance between liking someone and wanting them. One person''s pull meets the other person''s drive directly, and the chemistry can feel obvious from the start.', 'The attraction is immediate. Venus and Mars are in the same place, so there isn''t much distance between liking someone and wanting them. One person''s pull meets the other person''s drive directly, and the chemistry can feel obvious from the start.

This is the kind of connection where everything feels a little charged, even when the conversation itself is normal. There''s heat, there''s interest, and it can be easy to assume that because the attraction is strong, the relationship must be strong too.

Failure mode: mistaking wanting someone for actually being compatible with them. Things can burn hot and fast, then you realize there may not be much holding it together once the charge settles.

Let the spark introduce you. Then take a minute and see if you actually like each other.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"The attraction is immediate. Venus and Mars are in the same place, so there isn''t much distance between liking someone and wanting them. One person''s pull meets the other person''s drive directly, and the chemistry can feel obvious from the start.\n\nThis is the kind of connection where everything feels a little charged, even when the conversation itself is normal. There''s heat, there''s interest, and it can be easy to assume that because the attraction is strong, the relationship must be strong too.\n\nFailure mode: mistaking wanting someone for actually being compatible with them. Things can burn hot and fast, then you realize there may not be much holding it together once the charge settles.\n\nLet the spark introduce you. Then take a minute and see if you actually like each other."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"Failure mode: mistaking wanting someone for actually being compatible with them. Things can burn hot and fast, then you realize there may not be much holding it together once the charge settles."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Let the spark introduce you. Then take a minute and see if you actually like each other."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-mars_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"The classic chemistry contact. The Venus person feels wanted and pursued; the Mars person feels the pull and goes after it. Physical, immediate, hard to sit still around each other. Failure mode: mistaking heat for foundation - the attraction is real but says nothing about whether you can live together. Enjoy the spark, build the rest deliberately, and check what''s under it.","summaryDeep":"The attraction is immediate. Venus and Mars are in the same place, so there isn''t much distance between liking someone and wanting them. One person''s pull meets the other person''s drive directly, and the chemistry can feel obvious from the start.\n\nThis is the kind of connection where everything feels a little charged, even when the conversation itself is normal. There''s heat, there''s interest, and it can be easy to assume that because the attraction is strong, the relationship must be strong too.\n\nFailure mode: mistaking wanting someone for actually being compatible with them. Things can burn hot and fast, then you realize there may not be much holding it together once the charge settles.\n\nLet the spark introduce you. Then take a minute and see if you actually like each other.","tension":"Failure mode: mistaking wanting someone for actually being compatible with them. Things can burn hot and fast, then you realize there may not be much holding it together once the charge settles.","advice":"Let the spark introduce you. Then take a minute and see if you actually like each other.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-mars_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"mars","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-mars_opposition', 'synastry-venus-opposition-mars', 'relationship-venus-opposition-mars']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-mars_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-mars_opposition","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Opposition Mars', 'There''s real attraction here, but it may not feel simple. One person might move forward while the other pulls back, and that back-and-forth can become part of the chemistry. The distance creates heat, but it can also make the relationship feel like something always has to be chased.', 'There''s real attraction here, but it may not feel simple. One person might move forward while the other pulls back, and that back-and-forth can become part of the chemistry. The distance creates heat, but it can also make the relationship feel like something always has to be chased.

At its best, this keeps things exciting. At its worst, both people start confusing tension with connection. One person may feel rejected, while the other feels pressured.

Failure mode: only feeling the romance when there is friction, distance, or someone to win over. Once things get simple, the connection may start looking for a new problem.

Say what you want directly. Don''t make the other person figure it out from hints, timing, or attitude.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"There''s real attraction here, but it may not feel simple. One person might move forward while the other pulls back, and that back-and-forth can become part of the chemistry. The distance creates heat, but it can also make the relationship feel like something always has to be chased.\n\nAt its best, this keeps things exciting. At its worst, both people start confusing tension with connection. One person may feel rejected, while the other feels pressured.\n\nFailure mode: only feeling the romance when there is friction, distance, or someone to win over. Once things get simple, the connection may start looking for a new problem.\n\nSay what you want directly. Don''t make the other person figure it out from hints, timing, or attitude."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"Failure mode: only feeling the romance when there is friction, distance, or someone to win over. Once things get simple, the connection may start looking for a new problem."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Say what you want directly. Don''t make the other person figure it out from hints, timing, or attitude."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-mars_opposition","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Magnetic across a gap. Opposite styles of wanting - one pursues, one receives - and that polarity is exactly the draw. Failure mode: swinging between chase and retreat until both are worn out. Meet in the middle on purpose instead of acting out the chase.","summaryDeep":"There''s real attraction here, but it may not feel simple. One person might move forward while the other pulls back, and that back-and-forth can become part of the chemistry. The distance creates heat, but it can also make the relationship feel like something always has to be chased.\n\nAt its best, this keeps things exciting. At its worst, both people start confusing tension with connection. One person may feel rejected, while the other feels pressured.\n\nFailure mode: only feeling the romance when there is friction, distance, or someone to win over. Once things get simple, the connection may start looking for a new problem.\n\nSay what you want directly. Don''t make the other person figure it out from hints, timing, or attitude.","tension":"Failure mode: only feeling the romance when there is friction, distance, or someone to win over. Once things get simple, the connection may start looking for a new problem.","advice":"Say what you want directly. Don''t make the other person figure it out from hints, timing, or attitude.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-mars_sextile', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"mars","aspect":"sextile"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-mars_sextile', 'synastry-venus-sextile-mars', 'relationship-venus-sextile-mars']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-mars_sextile.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-mars_sextile","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Sextile Mars', 'The attraction is there, but it usually needs someone to do something with it. Venus and Mars support each other here, so charm and desire can work well together, but the chemistry may not fully open unless someone makes a move.', 'The attraction is there, but it usually needs someone to do something with it. Venus and Mars support each other here, so charm and desire can work well together, but the chemistry may not fully open unless someone makes a move.

This can start in a subtle way. A little flirting, a little effort, a little willingness to show interest. The more both people participate, the more the attraction has somewhere to go.

Failure mode: leaving the spark sitting there because everyone is waiting for it to become obvious on its own.

Reach for it. This aspect opens when someone acts.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"The attraction is there, but it usually needs someone to do something with it. Venus and Mars support each other here, so charm and desire can work well together, but the chemistry may not fully open unless someone makes a move.\n\nThis can start in a subtle way. A little flirting, a little effort, a little willingness to show interest. The more both people participate, the more the attraction has somewhere to go.\n\nFailure mode: leaving the spark sitting there because everyone is waiting for it to become obvious on its own.\n\nReach for it. This aspect opens when someone acts."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"Failure mode: leaving the spark sitting there because everyone is waiting for it to become obvious on its own."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Reach for it. This aspect opens when someone acts."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-mars_sextile","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Easy, low-friction attraction with a little spark. Desire and affection line up without much effort, and there''s room to act on it. Failure mode: pleasant enough to coast on and never deepen. Take the opening - make the move, plan the date - instead of waiting for it to escalate on its own.","summaryDeep":"The attraction is there, but it usually needs someone to do something with it. Venus and Mars support each other here, so charm and desire can work well together, but the chemistry may not fully open unless someone makes a move.\n\nThis can start in a subtle way. A little flirting, a little effort, a little willingness to show interest. The more both people participate, the more the attraction has somewhere to go.\n\nFailure mode: leaving the spark sitting there because everyone is waiting for it to become obvious on its own.\n\nReach for it. This aspect opens when someone acts.","tension":"Failure mode: leaving the spark sitting there because everyone is waiting for it to become obvious on its own.","advice":"Reach for it. This aspect opens when someone acts.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-mars_square', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"mars","aspect":"square"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-mars_square', 'synastry-venus-square-mars', 'relationship-venus-square-mars']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-mars_square.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-mars_square","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Square Mars', 'This is attraction with some edge to it. Venus and Mars want each other, but they don''t move together easily. The chemistry is real, but it can come with irritation, mixed signals, and that feeling that the other person knows exactly how to get under your skin.', 'This is attraction with some edge to it. Venus and Mars want each other, but they don''t move together easily. The chemistry is real, but it can come with irritation, mixed signals, and that feeling that the other person knows exactly how to get under your skin.

There may be a lot of heat here, but not all heat is intimacy. Sometimes the charge comes from being challenged. Sometimes it comes from feeling provoked. The trick is knowing the difference between passion and a pattern that keeps making you tense.

Failure mode: confusing friction for chemistry and staying because the conflict makes the connection feel alive.

Use the charge for something you''re building together. Don''t keep turning it on each other.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This is attraction with some edge to it. Venus and Mars want each other, but they don''t move together easily. The chemistry is real, but it can come with irritation, mixed signals, and that feeling that the other person knows exactly how to get under your skin.\n\nThere may be a lot of heat here, but not all heat is intimacy. Sometimes the charge comes from being challenged. Sometimes it comes from feeling provoked. The trick is knowing the difference between passion and a pattern that keeps making you tense.\n\nFailure mode: confusing friction for chemistry and staying because the conflict makes the connection feel alive.\n\nUse the charge for something you''re building together. Don''t keep turning it on each other."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"Failure mode: confusing friction for chemistry and staying because the conflict makes the connection feel alive."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Use the charge for something you''re building together. Don''t keep turning it on each other."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-mars_square","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Friction and pull in the same breath. You want each other and rub each other wrong - fights that turn into heat, heat that turns into fights. Failure mode: the fighting becomes the fuel and you confuse intensity for intimacy. Aim the charge at desire, not combat, and notice if the spark needs conflict to stay lit, because that burns out.","summaryDeep":"This is attraction with some edge to it. Venus and Mars want each other, but they don''t move together easily. The chemistry is real, but it can come with irritation, mixed signals, and that feeling that the other person knows exactly how to get under your skin.\n\nThere may be a lot of heat here, but not all heat is intimacy. Sometimes the charge comes from being challenged. Sometimes it comes from feeling provoked. The trick is knowing the difference between passion and a pattern that keeps making you tense.\n\nFailure mode: confusing friction for chemistry and staying because the conflict makes the connection feel alive.\n\nUse the charge for something you''re building together. Don''t keep turning it on each other.","tension":"Failure mode: confusing friction for chemistry and staying because the conflict makes the connection feel alive.","advice":"Use the charge for something you''re building together. Don''t keep turning it on each other.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-mars_trine', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"mars","aspect":"trine"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-mars_trine', 'synastry-venus-trine-mars', 'relationship-venus-trine-mars']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-mars_trine.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-mars_trine","importedStatus":"REVIEWED"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Trine Mars', 'Desire and attraction move easily here. The chemistry feels natural, warm, and unforced. Nobody has to work too hard to create interest, and there''s often a physical ease between the two people that feels simple in a good way.', 'Desire and attraction move easily here. The chemistry feels natural, warm, and unforced. Nobody has to work too hard to create interest, and there''s often a physical ease between the two people that feels simple in a good way.

This can be a very comfortable kind of attraction. The rhythm makes sense. The timing is easier. There''s less guessing, less proving, and less drama around who wants what.

Failure mode: taking the ease for granted. Because the connection does not demand constant effort, it can quietly stop being fed.

Keep choosing it. Just because something feels natural does not mean it can run forever on its own.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"Desire and attraction move easily here. The chemistry feels natural, warm, and unforced. Nobody has to work too hard to create interest, and there''s often a physical ease between the two people that feels simple in a good way.\n\nThis can be a very comfortable kind of attraction. The rhythm makes sense. The timing is easier. There''s less guessing, less proving, and less drama around who wants what.\n\nFailure mode: taking the ease for granted. Because the connection does not demand constant effort, it can quietly stop being fed.\n\nKeep choosing it. Just because something feels natural does not mean it can run forever on its own."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"Failure mode: taking the ease for granted. Because the connection does not demand constant effort, it can quietly stop being fed."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"Keep choosing it. Just because something feels natural does not mean it can run forever on its own."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-mars_trine","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"Attraction that flows naturally. You want each other in a way that feels effortless and warm, with little push-pull drama. Failure mode: effortless slides into complacency; easy chemistry still needs tending. Keep showing up for it - don''t assume it runs itself.","summaryDeep":"Desire and attraction move easily here. The chemistry feels natural, warm, and unforced. Nobody has to work too hard to create interest, and there''s often a physical ease between the two people that feels simple in a good way.\n\nThis can be a very comfortable kind of attraction. The rhythm makes sense. The timing is easier. There''s less guessing, less proving, and less drama around who wants what.\n\nFailure mode: taking the ease for granted. Because the connection does not demand constant effort, it can quietly stop being fed.\n\nKeep choosing it. Just because something feels natural does not mean it can run forever on its own.","tension":"Failure mode: taking the ease for granted. Because the connection does not demand constant effort, it can quietly stop being fed.","advice":"Keep choosing it. Just because something feels natural does not mean it can run forever on its own.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"REVIEWED","authoringStatus":"locked","weight":1}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-mercury_conjunction', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"mercury","aspect":"conjunction"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-mercury_conjunction', 'synastry-venus-conjunction-mercury', 'relationship-venus-conjunction-mercury']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-mercury_conjunction.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-mercury_conjunction","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Conjunction Mercury', null, 'This connection often feels good from the start. There may be something about the way this person speaks that puts you at ease. Their words can make you feel seen, appreciated, and understood. After spending time with them, you may walk away feeling a little lighter, a little more confident, or simply more like yourself.

When this aspect flows well, conversation becomes a source of connection. You encourage each other naturally. You may spend hours sharing ideas, talking about your hopes, or reflecting on life together. There is often a feeling that this person understands where you''re coming from, and that feeling can be deeply attractive.

You may also find that your values align in meaningful ways. What matters to you matters to them.

The downside is that comfort can become a habit. When things are easy between you, it''s tempting to stick to what feels good and avoid the conversations that are messier, riskier, or harder to navigate.

One of the gifts of this connection is that you naturally help each other feel seen and valued. That creates a strong foundation. The opportunity is to build on it.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This connection often feels good from the start. There may be something about the way this person speaks that puts you at ease. Their words can make you feel seen, appreciated, and understood. After spending time with them, you may walk away feeling a little lighter, a little more confident, or simply more like yourself.\n\nWhen this aspect flows well, conversation becomes a source of connection. You encourage each other naturally. You may spend hours sharing ideas, talking about your hopes, or reflecting on life together. There is often a feeling that this person understands where you''re coming from, and that feeling can be deeply attractive.\n\nYou may also find that your values align in meaningful ways. What matters to you matters to them.\n\nThe downside is that comfort can become a habit. When things are easy between you, it''s tempting to stick to what feels good and avoid the conversations that are messier, riskier, or harder to navigate.\n\nOne of the gifts of this connection is that you naturally help each other feel seen and valued. That creates a strong foundation. The opportunity is to build on it."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The downside is that comfort can become a habit. When things are easy between you, it''s tempting to stick to what feels good and avoid the conversations that are messier, riskier, or harder to navigate."},{"heading":"Advice","body":"One of the gifts of this connection is that you naturally help each other feel seen and valued. That creates a strong foundation. The opportunity is to build on it."}],"synastryKb":{"id":"A-venus_B-mercury_conjunction","kind":"interaspect","plainTranslation":"A''s love and values meets B''s mind. The conjunction fuses them - intense and inseparable.","summaryDeep":"This connection often feels good from the start. There may be something about the way this person speaks that puts you at ease. Their words can make you feel seen, appreciated, and understood. After spending time with them, you may walk away feeling a little lighter, a little more confident, or simply more like yourself.\n\nWhen this aspect flows well, conversation becomes a source of connection. You encourage each other naturally. You may spend hours sharing ideas, talking about your hopes, or reflecting on life together. There is often a feeling that this person understands where you''re coming from, and that feeling can be deeply attractive.\n\nYou may also find that your values align in meaningful ways. What matters to you matters to them.\n\nThe downside is that comfort can become a habit. When things are easy between you, it''s tempting to stick to what feels good and avoid the conversations that are messier, riskier, or harder to navigate.\n\nOne of the gifts of this connection is that you naturally help each other feel seen and valued. That creates a strong foundation. The opportunity is to build on it.","tension":"The downside is that comfort can become a habit. When things are easy between you, it''s tempting to stick to what feels good and avoid the conversations that are messier, riskier, or harder to navigate.","advice":"One of the gifts of this connection is that you naturally help each other feel seen and valued. That creates a strong foundation. The opportunity is to build on it.","policy":"Governed by synastry-policy. Descriptive, not deterministic; intensity is never treated as obligation, safety concerns override astrology.","note":"Synced from authored synastry bundle synastry-authored__19_ (2).json.","status":"DRAFT","authoringStatus":"draft","weight":3}}'::jsonb, 'synastry_aspect', 'Seeded from authored synastry KB. summaryShort is preserved as NULL when absent or null.', now()),
  ('A-venus_B-mercury_opposition', 'synastry', 'in_depth', 'LIVE', 'synastry-aspect', null::date, '{"kind":"interaspect","planetA":"venus","planetB":"mercury","aspect":"opposition"}'::jsonb, ARRAY['A-venus_B-mercury_opposition', 'synastry-venus-opposition-mercury', 'relationship-venus-opposition-mercury']::text[], '{"contentType":"synastry-kb-seed","source":"packages/astro-knowledge","sourcePath":"packages/astro-knowledge/data/synastry/aspects/A-venus_B-mercury_opposition.json","collection":"synastry/aspects","kbId":"A-venus_B-mercury_opposition","importedStatus":"DRAFT"}'::jsonb, 'synastry-kb-v1', null, 'Venus Opposition Mercury', null, 'This connection asks you to stretch beyond your usual understanding of affection.

This person may communicate care in ways that feel unfamiliar to you. The way they flirt, compliment, joke, or express appreciation may not be what you instinctively recognize as warmth. Still, there may be something magnetic about the contrast. Their way of expressing affection can challenge your assumptions and open you to forms of care you might not have noticed before.

Oppositions often bring us face-to-face with another perspective. In this case, the contrast can be compelling. This person may express warmth, affection, or appreciation in ways that feel unfamiliar to you. Their approach can stretch your understanding of connection, showing you that care does not always arrive in the form you expect. Over time, you may discover new ways of giving and receiving affection through the differences between you.

The challenge is that affection does not always arrive in a recognizable form. One person may think they are showing care, while the other does not feel cared for at all. What one person sees as thoughtful may feel distant to the other. What feels sincere may feel awkward. What seems obvious may not register at all.

Both people can end up feeling unseen. Each may be trying to connect in a genuine way, but what they offer is not what the other person needs. Even when there is care between you, it can be difficult to feel fully reached or understood.

The more clearly you learn how each of you gives and receives affection, the easier it becomes to recognize the care that is already there.', '{"sections":[{"heading":"Deep meaning","body":"This connection asks you to stretch beyond your usual understanding of affection.\n\nThis person may communicate care in ways that feel unfamiliar to you. The way they flirt, compliment, joke, or express appreciation may not be what you instinctively recognize as warmth. Still, there may be something magnetic about the contrast. Their way of expressing affection can challenge your assumptions and open you to forms of care you might not have noticed before.\n\nOppositions often bring us face-to-face with another perspective. In this case, the contrast can be compelling. This person may express warmth, affection, or appreciation in ways that feel unfamiliar to you. Their approach can stretch your understanding of connection, showing you that care does not always arrive in the form you expect. Over time, you may discover new ways of giving and receiving affection through the differences between you.\n\nThe challenge is that affection does not always arrive in a recognizable form. One person may think they are showing care, while the other does not feel cared for at all. What one person sees as thoughtful may feel distant to the other. What feels sincere may feel awkward. What seems obvious may not register at all.\n\nBoth people can end up feeling unseen. Each may be trying to connect in a genuine way, but what they offer is not what the other person needs. Even when there is care between you, it can be difficult to feel fully reached or understood.\n\nThe more clearly you learn how each of you gives and receives affection, the easier it becomes to recognize the care that is already there."},{"heading":"Tension","body":"The challenge is that affection does not always arrive in a recognizable form. One person may think they are showing care, while the other does not feel cared for at